{"id":"cmq9sod0i000t10hnlsq625wl","description":"Summer Hash BBQ Run hared by Mark Sex. \nTrail: A to B.  Start at Valadares Railway Station. V.N. Gaia \nAs usual, meet at 2pm fir 2:30pm Start\nBash at GM's house for BBQ \nBBQ fee: approx. 13 euros per adult including meats and drinks.  Horror - half price.\n\nTo make sure there's enough grub to feed your hungry face, please sign in for BBQ by Wednesday 16 Jul - or forever to hold your empty plate.   Whether you are coming for the meat, the fire or the beer, we need a headcount.\n\nDo not miss the trail with BBQ in a great summer day!\n\nON ON","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9sod51000v10hnngcu0usa","description":"Hare : Swing Low\nMeet at 2pm for 2:30pm Start : The pogada, adjecent to children playground at Jardim do Morro\nHey hey, you lovable misfits!\nTime to dust off those trail shoes, hydrate with beer and embrace your inner half mind - Run #16 is coming in hot!\n\nON ON","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9sod93000x10hnt33okp48","description":"Hared by Mark Sex\nMeet & Start at Parque de Estacionamento do Rossio, Santa Maria da Feira (see location map)\nSign the bloody invitation and join us in conquering the legendary Castelo do Santa Maria da Feira & it's fairytale surroundings.  Bring your thirst, your trail legs, and dodogiest jokes.  ON ON","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9soe5f000z10hndo1k3edm","description":"LAST HASH FOR AUGUST\nHare: Swing Low \nVenue: Metro Manuel Leão (D), Vila Nova de Gaia \nMeet at 2pm for 2:30pm start\n\nThe hare swears it's normal .... hash translation \n\nYou WILL get lost\nYou WILL question your life choice You MIGHT explore parts of Gaia you didn't know existed!\n\nBring your legs, your lungs, and your thirst Run, crawl,  or stagger - Just DON'T miss it.  ON ON👣🍻","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9soek0001110hntnvfmy6p","description":"Hared by Swing Low to explore Espinho\nFresh from the Iberian Hash Tour, we're back on Trail!\nSign up, bring your friends, and come share the laughs, run/walk, stumble, drink - whatever your style, just don't miss it!  On On","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
