{"id":"cmqsi4cq4004k04i8v39vptx6","description":"******WHO? / 誰?******\nHare 主兔: Flasher\nCohare 副兔: Cums Once a Year\n\n******WHAT? / 蝦咪*******\nA:A run / 路線：A to A\nS: 8.5 km + Elevation/爬升: 350 m\nL: 13 km + Elevation/爬升: 550 m\n\n*******WHEN / 啥時*******\nDate: Sunday, 12 July 2026\nTime: Hares off at 14:00\n兔子兩點起跑\n\n*******WHERE / 哪兒*******\n牡丹活動廣場\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/mgUGwAohdcn4L2vQ6\n\n******HOW? / 怎去*******\nTake the TRA to Mudan station then walk to the run start\n台鐵到牡丹站然後走路到A點\nRun start has parking\nA點有停車位\n\n*******PRICE*******\nMen $250 Women $200\n\n*******BASH / 晚餐*******\n五十年老店- 蘭香大飯店\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/MGr8aYQW9VzFSaZ77","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"NT$ 250","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmqsi4cr8004m04i8fsk2g6y0","description":"******WHO? / 誰?******\nHare 主兔: 2nd Man In\nCohare 副兔: Lick a Slower Spick\n\n******WHAT? / 蝦咪*******\nA:B run / 路線：A to B\nS: 4.5 km + Elevation/爬升: 150 m\nL: 7.5 km + Elevation/爬升: 150 m\n\n*******WHEN / 啥時*******\nDate: Sunday, 5 July 2026\nTime: Hares off at 14:30\n兔子兩點半起跑\n\n*******WHERE / 哪兒*******\nA:\nJinshan District Fishermen's Association\n金山區漁會\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/yWizn7ibZpPT6guN7\nB:\nNew Jinshan Beach\n金山海水浴場\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/hwocRZkRotGAehoe9\n\n******HOW? / 怎去*******\nTake Bus 1815 from Taipei Main Station to Huanggang Rd then walk to the run start\n從台北火車站搭公車1815到磺港路然後走到A點","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"NT$ 250","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmqsi4csb004o04i8ub3s7rzc","description":"******WHO? / 誰?******\nHare 主兔: Cherry Popper\nCohare 副兔: Just Jack\n\n******WHAT? / 蝦咪*******\nA:A run / 路線：A to A\nS: 7 km + Elevation/爬升: 300 m\nL: 8 km + Elevation/爬升: 400 m\n\n*******WHEN / 啥時*******\nDate: Sunday, 19 July 2026\nTime: Hares off at 14:00\n兔子兩點起跑\n\n*******WHERE / 哪兒*******\n南新宮\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/9pADWkV1zzq5XwAbA\n\n******HOW? / 怎去*******\nParty bus leaves from Zhongxiao Fuxing at 12:15\n派對巴士12:15從忠孝復興出發\nParking available near the run start\nA點有停車位\n\n*******PRICE*******\nMen $250 Women $200\n\n*******BASH / 晚餐*******\nXin Zhong Tian Restaurant\n新中天餐廳\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/JPfso7vmoE7sA5ZU6","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"NT$ 250","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmqsi4ctk004q04i8v3rj3j76","description":"******WHO? / 誰?******\nHare 主兔: Elwood Blues\nCohare 副兔: Sticky Fingers\n\n******WHAT? / 蝦咪*******\nA:A run / 路線：A to A\nS: 6 km + Elevation/爬升: 350 m\nL: 7.5 km + Elevation/爬升: 400 m\n\n*******WHEN / 啥時*******\nDate: Sunday, 26 July 2026\nTime: Hares off at 14:30\n兔子兩點半起跑\n\n*******WHERE / 哪兒*******\nJheng Da Tea Garden\n正大休閒茶園\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/hffEgQSWJhPPr9KJ8\n\n******HOW? / 怎去*******\nTake the Maokong Gondola from the Taipei Zoo Metro stop. After exiting the station, walk left for about 5-10 minutes. The venue is on the right. Go up to the 2nd floor.\n搭乘貓空纜車，出站後向左步行約5至10分鐘（在右手邊，請上2樓）即可抵達\n\n*******PRICE*******\nMen $250 Women $200\n\n*******BASH / 晚餐*******\nJheng Da Tea Garden\n正大休閒茶園\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/hffEgQSWJhPPr9KJ8","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"NT$ 250","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmqu7635n0002v4hndl286z73","description":"BHHH2 Run 2309: Gd. BHHH2 Panorama, Lembang\nBIRTHDAY RUN!\n\nWhen: Friday, 26 June 2026\nRun Start: 2:30pm sharp local time\nTips: Arrive well beforehand to prepare for run, buy Run Fee\n\nWhere: Gedung BHHH2, Komplek Panorama Indah, Lembang\nGmaps keyword search: Gedung BHHH2\n\nHares: Sian & Chuie\nRun Options: Short (4km), Medium (7km), Long (10km)\n\nTicketing Team: Ie Mey, Ay Chen, Unuy (Group IV)\nRun Fee: Rp15.000 under 40 y.o, Rp25.000 over 40 y.o\n\nWhen on the run, please keep in mind:\n- Do not step on, stomp on, or pick up any fruits, crops nor vegetables - they belong to someone\n- Refrain from being noisy around places of worship\n- Do not forget to buy your Run Fee!","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"Rp 25,000","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmqyilovr000d04lkmvc729hr","description":"BHHH2 Run 2310: Hotel Graha Universal, Setiabudi\n\nWhen: Friday, 3 July 2026\nRun Start: 3:30pm sharp local time\nTips: Arrive well beforehand to prepare for run, buy Run Fee\n\nWhere: Hotel Graha Universal, Setiabudi\nGmaps keyword search: Hotel GH Universal\n\nHares: Aho GP & Daeng\nRun Options: Short (4km), Medium (7km), Long (10km)\n\nTicketing Team: Poppy G, Catherine, Chika (Group I)\nRun Fee: Rp15.000 under 40 y.o, Rp25.000 over 40 y.o - can buy on site\nNOTE: As this is a special event, no ticket means no entry to event!\n\nWhen on the run, please keep in mind:\n- Do not step on, stomp on, or pick up any fruits, crops nor vegetables - they belong to someone\n- Refrain from being noisy around places of worship\n- Do not forget to buy your Run Fee!","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"Rp 25,000","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
