{"id":"cmr2iwoey00079whnfrfft2bq","description":"Moonies Christmas Party Full Moon Run,\nstart 4.30 pm for 5.00 pm start,\npark behind cheers bar.\nred Santa theme,\n5km Full Moon Hash with Beer stop,\nBeer after the run.\nShared set menu with shared Towers of beer,!!\nlive music, bad dancing and singing.\nFREE raffle and prizes.\nprice 800 Baht Drinkers,\n600 baht non drinkers,\nto register\n[redacted]\ncan pre pay at any of the following full moon or sunday runs.\npayments to Peter clarke, Bangkok Bank , [redacted]\nCAN PAY AT ANY FULL MOON OR BUSH HASH\n\nclosing date 5th Dec after that 1000 baht.","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"THB 200","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2iwojb00099whnzfumu0p7","description":"ON ON! HUA HIN FULL MOON HASH # (39) 🌕🍻\nCalling all Hounds, Harriers, and Harriettes! It’s time to follow the flour and chase the moon. We’re heading to the hills (or the back streets!) of Soi 102 for a moonlit trail. Whether you’re an FRB (Front Running Bastard) or a dedicated member of the SCB (Short Cutting Bastards), there’s a trail for you!\n📅 WHEN: Sunday, 18th January 2026\n📍 WHERE: Soi 102, Hua Hin (behind MY STYLE CONDO)\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/Po6NNygkr5fLUUUT9\n🕓 TIME: Meet at 4:30 PM | Hare off at 5:00 PM sharp!\nTHE DETAILS: 👣 Trails: Runner and Walker trails provided.\n🍺 The Reward: Ice-cold amber nectar at the Beer Stop and a proper Circle to follow.\n🔦 Essentials: Bring a torch (it’s a Full Moon run, duh!), shiggy-ready shoes, and your sense of humor.\n💰 Hash Cash: (kids drink beer FREE, Wankers 100 baht, Drinkers 200 baht) (Includes beers, water, and snacks).\nDon't be a \"Loon under the Moon\"—get your gear ready for a classic Soi 102 bash!\nOn-On!","street":"31/350, ซอยโรงเรียนแย้มสะอาด","loc":"soi 102","cost":"THB 200","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
