{"id":"cmr2ixasl003f04l11y2vusx9","description":"The Full Moon 4th Anniversary Weekend: July 11th - 12th, 2026! 🌙\nJoin the Hua Hin Full Moon Hash House Harriers (HHFMH3)\n\nfor an incredible, action-packed celebration!\n\n(34 booked already mostly international visitors!)\n\nOptional Adventure: Take the train to Phetchaburi!\n\nJoin a group of hashers for a fun Sat lunchtime train ride to Phetchaburi\n\n(details on train times will follow).\n\nApprox 13 baht!\n\n🟢 Day 1: Saturday, July 11th - The Legendary 7-ELEVEN Hash!\n\nTime: 5:00 PM (Start) 7/11 Hash. beer stop inc. \n\nbuy your own at each 711.\n\nOption for ladies to enjoy the night market!\n\nLocation: Phetchaburi Town Centre Mintara Hotel (book with us)\n\nPost-Hash: Dinner and Drinks at night market restaurant,\n\nSet menu and shared beers provided. \n\n🔵 Day 2: Sunday Morning, July 12th - The Hangover Hike! 🚠\n\nCure your post-party blues with a scenic, optional run/walk, featuring a very unique shortcut!\n\nEvent: Morning Hangover Hash & Cable Car Shortcut!\n\nTime: 10:00 AM (Start)\n\nLocation: Phetchaburi Town Centre Area\n\n\n(From the base of Khao Wang/Phra Nakhon Khiri).\n\nPost-Hash: Light Lunch/snacks and recovery drinks\n\n🔴 Day 2: Sunday Evening, July 12th - FULL MOON ANNIVERSARY & BIRTHDAY BASH!\n\nOur main event: a classic Full Moon Hash trail \n\nfollowed by a massive party celebrating four incredible years of HHFMH3 \n\nand Penny Lame's 60th!\n\nEvent: 4th Anniversary Trail & Penny Lame's 60th Birthday Bash!\n\nTime: 5:00 PM (Start) – To run into the evening light!\n\nLocation: Phetchaburi Town Centre Area starts  (Mintara hotel)\n\nFull moon trail with beer stop\n\n\nPost-Hash Party: \n\nSet menu,, Birthday Cake, & Live Music at TBA \n\n🎁 Full Extravaganza Registration\n\nFull Weekend Package Cost: 1,750 BAHT\n\nNon drinkers              1,450 baht\n\n \n(Hotel extra we have a group discount\n\n contact penny lame)\n\nNormal rate 1100 and 1000 baht\n\nWe have limited twin rooms (double beds) \n\n700 baht a night\n\nTwin singles with 2 lg single beds\n\n 800 a night.\n\n(we need 50% deposit for rooms asap)\n\n---------","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"THB 200","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2ixatk003h04l1lcw76wbk","description":"Join the Harriettes for an evening of fun, all profits to charity, behind bluport car park","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"THB 200","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr3rj38v0001hbhnjetcrt2f","description":"Party & Games Hash\nBrazil Nuts Hash House Harriers (BNH3) is delighted to announce its next trail and *confraternização* party 🎉\nMeet at 13:00, trail starts 13:30.\nAfter trail and circle there’ll be fun & games at the bar.\n\n📍 Meeting point: Bar Delas, Itanhaém. Facing Rio Preto football pitch\n\nHare: MaBouche \nA-A run 🔂\nBag 🎒 drop \nPlenty free parking \nHash cash: R$ 35 for beer 🍺 drinkers/ R$ 10 for soft 💧 drinkers\nHash gear 👕 on sale\nBring a change of footwear\n\n➕You’re welcome to join us all weekend! Stay overnight at Bar Delas guest space (R$150 pp bed, breakfast, meal, bar) or the accommodation of your choice in Itanhaém area.\n🚍 Getting there: Piracicabana buses leave every hour from Jabaquara and take 2 hours to Itanhaém bus station. Uber/99 the last 9km.","street":"Rua Dos Jaras - Estr. Do Rio Preto, 11755-890","loc":"Bar Delas Itanhaém","cost":"R$35","clear_run":null,"old_title":"#263","title":"Brazil Nuts H3 #263","clear_time":false},
