{"id":"cmr3rk9wj004fjbhnx8xm7qn6","description":"On On:  Seaview Road, Bridge of Don, Aberdeen AB23 8JL\n\nTo get there - turn off Scotstown Road on to Scotstown Gardens at Balgownie Community Centre, and Bowling Club. Their car park is a bit small, so go past them by 50 yards or so, turn the corner on to Seaview Road and the On On car park is on the corner, next to the big pink house.\n\nGooglemaps link:\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/C3SmMqv5cAk2gNA99\n\nWhat 3 Words - return.tower.long\nhttps://w3w.co/return.tower.long","street":"1 Seaview Road, AB23 8JA, AB23 8JL","loc":null,"cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr3rka39004hjbhnlob9b6w7","description":"OnOn: Car park at end of Mill Road, Port Elphinstone.\n\nTake A96 north to Inverurie (Port Elphinstone) roundabout, turn Right to Inverurie (B993). Turn right after BP garage into Mill Road. Car Park at end. OS Ref NJ 779 193. 57.263529, -2.368746\n\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/xu7817iv6SZmK8kv9\n\nNB Other info: The trail should not go through any fields with livestock, but there might be times when dogs should be on leads.\n\nOn Inn: Chez TRC, Sangara, Fullerton Farm, Thainstone AB51 0YR.\n\nGo back onto A96, south to Thainstone roundabout. Turn left to Kirkwood Commercial Park, turn right through gates. Park on the grass OS Ref NJ 781 182. \n\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/FCAbh8vM2ZkyfuSQ8","street":"Elphinstone Road, AB51 5UD","loc":null,"cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
