{"id":"cmr3rkac6004ljbhnzjyt93i6","description":"NB Summer Time starts.  Don't forget to change your clocks - put them FORWARD one hour. Don't be late!!\n\nOn On: Insch Railway Station, off B9002.  \nGooglemaps link - https://maps.app.goo.gl/6z4oDiTEW1DqPeTb6?g_st=ic\n\nPerfect location for a beer afterwards, as you can get the train 😃  The 10:03 from Aberdeen gets in to Insch at 10:38 - perfect!\n\nThis Hash will cover some quite challenging terrain, so don’t wear shorts!! 🤪. It is a longish one at 4.75miles or 7.6km for you metric youngsters! 😆\nSome fields might have sheep with lambs.  If so, please keep all dogs on leads and don't stress them.\n\nOn Inn: chez Blagger. Please bring cash, as I will be raising money for Bennachie Leisure Centre - I am the treasurer of this community run facility, which is a registered charity. We no longer get funding from the Council and we are struggling to cover all our costs. \n\nThere will be soup & cake - bring your own beer (there’s a Coop in the village you’ll pass on the way from the station to my house 😊)\n\nOn Inn: 4 Simpson Brae, Insch AB52 6SZ\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/5yy76JrBn9hDMdfdA\n\n\nOn on!! 👣","street":"North Road, AB52 6XP","loc":null,"cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
