{"id":"cmr3rkfo0006vjbhn4oj6s9az","description":"On On:\nHaddo House main car park. \nPlease park at the bottom of the car park. Note that there are now parking charges at Haddo House, £3.50 for the day, card payment works.  It is about 40 minutes drive from middle of town. Dog friendly though there are some trail sections where lead is requested. Bike friendly, with imagination. \n \nGoogle Maps: https://maps.app.goo.gl/cRzs3qj7LQbQQ8SU8\n \nOn Inn: To be decided, possibly Newmachar. There are two cafes at Haddo for Sunday lunch options, neither serve alcohol.","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
