{"id":"cmr3rkj2j008bjbhn4pclrjh3","description":"OnOn:  East Woodlands House, Pitmedden Road, Dyce\n\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/8SffJM11Zp7p7W4g8   or\n\nWhat 3 words:  deeper.activity.headsets  https://w3w.co/deeper.activity.headsets\n\nOn arrival take either driveway or the track and park on the sand school beyond the house. If it’s a very sunny night and a big pack is expected please car share to help parking.\n\n On Inn:  East Woodlands House.\n\nThere will be a BBQ of burgers, with veggie burgers too, Eggceptional salads to commemorate July 4th  - no fireworks but maybe a bonfire!  Donations accepted if you wish to support Eggfoo’s Botswana Homeopaths.","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
