{"id":"cmr3rkkcw008vjbhnt8e0mts0","description":"OnOn: Bin Forest, near Huntly  \nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/umdu7Mn98c99spu8A\n\nWe will be running with our friends from the Elgin hash, as this is our joint AH3/Elgin run! There are unconfirmed rumours that we might be celebrating their 40th birthday. \n\nOnInn: The Bank Cafe & Restaurant in Huntly. \n\nTo attend the OnInn, RSVP to Blagger by Wed 11th September. (Or earlier!) \n\nGenerous transport offer from the hare:\n\nIn an effort to reduce our carbon footprint, I am happy to collect and drop people off at Huntly station, so you will also be able to enjoy a drink. If you are interested in doing this the 10:03 train from Aberdeen gets in to Huntly at 10:55 and there are trains returning to Aberdeen at either 13:52 or 16:47. We'll be able to collect & drop off up to 8 people. \n\nI know this is quite far for people to come out but it's a dead easy journey, as the start is just off the A96 with plenty of parking and the restaurant for the On Inn looks very nice, so let's hope we can get plenty folk to come along.","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
