{"id":"cmr3rvprj00153mhn1ftnhfxf","description":"17 Miles A to B from Haymarket Station to somewhere reasonably central. \n\nIt does not involve riding on busy roads (except to get to the On Inn), though it does cross a couple.\n\nYou could manage it on any bike, though some sections are on pretty bumpy paths, so you would definitely prefer not to have narrow road tyres.\n\nI've copied Red Jumper's idea of a lunch/beer stop at (roughly) the mid point.  If folk could let me know if they're coming, it would help me get the numbers right...","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"£2","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
