{"id":"cmr3rvrdt001v3mhnydq1fvb7","description":"Work commitments mean we've lost our hare for this trail.\n\nSo we'll go for a hareless whizz along West Lothian's Shale Trail (see https://shaletrail.co.uk ) from West Calder to Winchburgh, and then in to Linlithgow for a pint. \n\nThat's a total of about 20 miles, with (hopefully!) no checks, but things to read and look at.\n\nEdinburgh folks note that the 10:26 from Waverley arrives in West Calder at 10:57","street":"Station Road, EH55 8BS","loc":"West Calder Station Car Park","cost":"£30","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
