{"id":"cmr3rvsmj002f3mhngii0snyv","description":"Not a trail, just a simple ride to get the season going.\n\nWe'll aim to set off PROMPTLY at 11:35.\n\nThere are trains arriving at Inverkeithing at 11:13, 11:21 and 11:28.  BUT to avoid overloading the bike space, please DON'T all aim to come on the 11:28!  I'm going to aim for the 11:13.\n\nMegasaurarse is coming on the ride, and has booked a tables in The Cambridge Bar in Edinburgh to watch the Scotland/France rugby match.  This starts at 2pm, and she would be happy to have folks from the ride join her group.  \n\nGoogle Maps says that the ride should take about an hour and a half, so we should be able to get there in good time.  \n\nIf you DO want to join her/us, please say so, and she will try to extend her booking.","street":"Inverkeithing Railway Station, KY11 1DA","loc":"Inverkeithing Station","cost":"£2","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
