{"id":"cmr3rvsw3002j3mhnih9846h2","description":"Assaulty Dog is the hare, and she says...\n\nLOCATION HAS CHANGED!!\n\nKiltWalk is using chunks of the canal path along the originally planned route,\nand so the route has changed.\n\nMeet Glasgow Queen Street rail station 11:15 for 11:30 start.\n\nRoute will be on tarmac cycle paths and small country roads. Mostly flat with short hills near start and end.\n\nThere will be one cafe stop and one beer stop so bring your usual payment methods.","street":"North Hanover Street, G1 2AF","loc":"Entrance near Platform 7 at Glasgow Queen Street station","cost":"£2","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr3rvt0r002l3mhn3tcglxkg","description":"Pickmeup, she say...\n\n   Direct trains from Waverley.\n   Alternative trains from Waverley to Newcraighall and cycle 1.5 miles to the start.\n\nAnd she assures us that the trail doesn't go anywhere near the Edinburgh Marathon route...","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"£2","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
