{"id":"cmr8geakt0003owhns96awq1s","description":"A Regional Hash in Serbia which celebrates Ex-Yugoslavia and The Balkans.  PLEASE REGISTER ON WEBSITE UNTIL APRIL 27th\n\nThis is a 3 day event that takes place in Belgrade and in a nearby city, Valjevo, in Serbia.\n\nMay 1st - Bucket O'Meat Welcome Dinner at Stara Herzegovina\n\nMay 2nd - Valjevo For Virgins Away Hash\n\nMay 3rd - Kale MegaHangover Hash\n\nThe fee for the event is 65 Euros.  This covers a welcome dinner, train tickets, downs-downs for all hashes and special hasherdashery.\n\nOFFICIAL WEBSITE\n\nhttps://sites.google.com/view/yugohash2026","street":"Carigradska 36, 11000","loc":"Belgrade, Serbia","cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr8geap40005owhnxdudj6x0","description":"Rather than July 4th Liberation events, we're having a Belgrade Beer Liberators event.  We will meet at the \nLiberators of Belgrade Memorial Park\n(Спомен-парк Ослободиоцима Београда) at 15hr this Saturday.\n\nBecause I want you feel liberated on this glorious day, it will be on a Saturday, and it will be a short trail (at least short in this running racist bastard's mind.)  Even better, it's A to A, so if you get lost, just go back to where we started and find the nearest bar.\n\nStill, there will be 3 beers stops, a nearby on-after, and good weather that won't burn your ass off.  On-on and volim te sve!","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"RSD 350","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
