{"id":"cmr8gfeaa000fqthnlrrw06pk","description":"Bike-Hash!!! \nFISHHH #8\nBikes + Hash = BASH (/BHASH?)\nTanzi Train Station\nSunday April 23\nMeet 12:15\nChalk Talk 12:45\nHares Away 1:00\n\nTHIS IS A BRING YOUR OWN BOOZE EVENT. There will be convenience stores at the beginning and end. As for bicycles, you may bring your own or use Taiwan's YouBike system.\n\nHares Frog Fucker and Greg have crafted a not too difficult, not too long course for everyone's Sunday afternoon enjoyment. Short trail is just under 16km. Longer trail is closer to 20. Some moderate hills, but mostly flat. Course is A to B, but A to A rules will be in effect (explained in detail at the event start). \n\nIf you plan to use a YouBike, recommended you secure one before Tanzi Station, as supplies at any one station are limited. Let's BASH, everybody!","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
