{"id":"cmre7iiyj0001vihnxs94r4vm","description":"Please join us for the very first run of the Lyon Hash House Harriers.\nA few \"seasoned\" hashers are needed to show the local virgins how a hash run is disorganised! \n \nWhat: Lyon H3 inaugural run \n \nWhen: Saturday November 2nd 2024, start at 14:00 \n \nWhere: in front of MJC Confluence, 28 Quai Rambaud, 69002 Lyon\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/MDT4ugeKAfzLT4NT9\n \nHow to get there: 20 min walk from Lyon Perrache train station, or tram T1 or T2 till stop \"Hôtel de région - Montrochet\". \n \nHares: Hidden Asset + I Like your Boobs \n \nHash Cash : 5€ \n \nBagdrop: yes, but keep it small\nA to A run, runners and wankers trail \n \nOn After : in a bar/resto nearby\nOn On to Lyon H3 inaugural run!","street":"28 Quai Rambaud, 69002","loc":"MJC Confluence","cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7ij780003vihnsmdpej51","description":"Is your head still hurting from drinking too much of that Beaujolais nouveau? Or are your legs killing you because you were carzy enough to run the Marathon du Beaujolais?\n\nWell, let's grab some fresh air and get rid of that hangover!\n\n \n\nWhen : Sunday 24. November 2024 at 12:00\nWhere : Entrance of Parc de la Tête d'Or (49 Boulevard des Belges/Rue Tête d'Or)\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/TGhpNcmXhhxaZ7xA6\nHow to get there from Part-Dieu train station: 10 min bus ride (line C1 or C6). Or 2km walk.\nHare : Hidden Asset\nHashcash : 5€\nBagdrop : probably not a big one. Leave your heavy shit at home or in the leftluggage at the train station","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7ijg10005vihncjjk833b","description":"Jingle balls, jingle balls! It's that time of year again! Join us for Lyon H3 Christmas run!\nWhen : Sunday 15th December 2024 at 14:00\nWhere : Place Bellecour, Meet at the north east corner of the Place, by the Metro exit, just accross from the Crédit mutuel.\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/9GuEQNdnFHsFicKu6\nHare : Lazy Swinger\nHashcash : 5€\nBagdrop : probably no, carry your own shite\nWhat: It's Christmas, please wear appropriate green or red hashgear, your best Santa outfit or your uggliest Christmas Jumper!\nOn after: we will go to the Christmas market after the run, and warm us up with a well deserved mulled wine!","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7ijo80007vihn4d5wy5ys","description":"It's a brand new year, so let's not \"Negliject\" our New Year's resolutions : run more? Drink less? be polite? no more rude songs?\n\nLet's find out! Join us for Lyon H3 run #4\nWhen : Sunday 12th January 2025 at 14:00\n \nWhere : Parc Sisley.\nMeet at the entrance of the parc, accross 11 rue du professeur Paul Sisley.\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/nYbnDpRY8rgVAaBcA\n \nTram 3 or 7, stop Dauphiné-Lacassagne\n \nHare : Neglijected + a co-hare would be appreciated - please volunteer to help!\nHashcash : 5€\nBagdrop : probably not, carry your own shite\nWhat: A to A run, walkers and runners trail available","street":"11 rue du professeur Paul Sisley, 69007","loc":"Parc Sisley","cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7ijso0009vihn16ooj3n7","description":"Candelmass is around the corner, and in France it means only one thing: Crêpes! For the occasion, our hares plan on letting the pack flip around Jean Macé, in search of the true trail. But will there be enough flour left for the pancakes on after??\n\nLet's find out! Join us for Lyon H3 run #5\nWhen : Sunday February 2nd 2025 at 14:00\n \nWhere :  36 Rue Jaboulay, 69007 Lyon, at the entrance of the parc\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/tqyrgtzuVoKuBCPh7 \n \nHow to get there: Metro line B Jean Macé, Tram 1 or 2\n \nHare : Lazy Swinger + Just Jaime\nHashcash : 5€\nBagdrop : yes\nWhat: A to A run, walkers and runners trail available\n \nOn-after : Crêpes at Hidden Asset's","street":"Rue Jaboulay 36","loc":"36 Rue Jaboulay, 69007 Lyon","cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7ijx8000bvihnxlc87z5e","description":"An old urban legend says, a beautifull hashtrail was once laid in the Parc de la Tête d'or... but the elements always prevented the hashers to run it... let's try again this time!\n\nWhen : Sunday 23. February at 14:00\nWhere : Entrance of Parc de la Tête d'Or (49 Boulevard des Belges/Rue Tête d'Or)\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/TGhpNcmXhhxaZ7xA6\nHow to get there from Part-Dieu train station: 10 min bus ride (line C1 or C6). Or 2km walk.\nHare : Hidden Asset\nHashcash : 5€\nBagdrop : probably not a big one. Leave your heavy shit at home","street":"Boulevard des Belges 49","loc":"Parc de la Tête d'Or","cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7ik7a000dvihn9w1ok2q6","description":"St Patrick's run hared by Tintin + Lazy Swinger, probably Lyon 1 area","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
