{"id":"cmre7kg9v000c04l1ijeposkp","description":"You can get the Swedes out of Agde, but you can't get Agde out of the Swedes...\nLittle Brother and John Cleese will set a trail in Cap d'Agde Area. \n\n They are promissing us : A runners and walkers trail with Drinkstop, including harbours, beaches, alleys and lots of fun.\n\nWhen : Saturday September 26th 2026, at 14:00\n\nWhere :  meeting in the big carpark, next to the Commissariat de Police, Avenue des Sergents, in Cap d'Agde. Look for the hashcar!\n\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/PaBpuvTMENq5qhL46 \n\nHow to get there :\n\nTravel to Agde and take bus 3 or 4 to \"Musée - Centre Cap\" at Cap D'agde. \n\nBus number 3 to Vieux Port leaves 13:10 and will be at Musée 13:58. 24 stations.   \nBus number 4 to Cap Est - Village Naturiste leaves 13:30 and will be at Musée 13:50. 11 stations\nDownload the app \"Zenbus\" and see everything in IRL, the timetable might change.\n \nThe start is 3 min walk from the  \"Musée - Centre Cap\" bus stop\nHare : Little Brother + John Cleese\n\nHashcash : 5€\n\nBag drop : yes\n\nOn-After :May be!","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmrjnhltc006104ihbhsruyzw","description":"When: Monday 27th July, 6pm \n\nHare: Arselicker \n\nWhere: Hare's House, Funchais, Tor \n\nGoogle Co-ordinates:  37.197696, -8.040996   \n\nInstructions:\n\nPlease email the Hare, ASAP, to let him know if you wish to attend on [redacted] \n\nBring a Chair, just in case\n\nBring Sticks if you need then\n\nBring a Plate and Cutlery if you want to be posh!!\n\nSorry only two legged Hashers this week, no Dogs please\n\nHareline: 919 938 437\n\nDirections:\nComing from Loule on the road towards Salir you cross the dried river at Ponte da Tor and at the traffic lights turn left. \n\nAfter about 50 m drive straight on through the small crossroads and after about another 50m there is a turning on the right for Tor, IGNORE this and carry straight on for 1.5km and then turn right for Funchais.  \n\n* Follow this road round to the right past Cafe \"1st Maio\" and after about 300m there is a bus stop on the left, take the first left concrete track after the bus stop and follow this for about 300m. \nPark up near the green wheelie bin and the Hare's house is up on the left. \n\nFrom Paragil to Benafim road turn right to Tor after you have gone over the river bridge, and through Ribeiro Algibre. \nFollow the road for about 4km to the Funchais turning on the left then carry on as above* \n\nON ON!","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
