{"id":"cmro86tlp0019oihnnnq12u9i","description":"*DOULIU H3*  Night trail in Shetou, Changhua \n🗓 SATURDAY, June 28th, 2025\n#️⃣ Run #【第193跑】, A-to-B, the \"Frog Fucker's Revenge\" Run\n🤝 MEET 【地點】: from ~17:00 pm at *SHETOU* station, then get taxis to the start.\n🏁  START: be AT the start BY 6 pm\n Long Quan Gong【龍泉宮】\n📍: maps.app.goo.gl/sSVxUZJEMGqu3LUh6\n🐇 Hares: Eh Hole + Sleeping Sausage >>> ETD: ~6:15-30 pm\n💲 Fee【收費 】:  男生♂/女生♀ NT$300 \n Summer rules apply: runners' trail can be up to about 8km.\n🏃🏻‍ Runners' :  ~7km???\n🚶🏻‍ Walkers' :  4-6km???\n↗ Elevation: Probably some up n down\n🍺 Halfway Stash: Maybe??\n🚻 Washroom: Yes\n🚲 YouBikes: NOPE!, but maybe Moovo\n🚎 BUS: ??\n🚄TRAINS: from the north, take #2203 / 3035 local \n from the south, #116/118/~120 express // 3146/2184 local\nℹ More info :  www.fb.com/events/1764155597810703","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"NT$ 300","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
