{"id":"cmrxxvuv7003604ic7dw8nfsy","description":"******WHO? / 誰?******\nHare 主兔: Period\nCohare 副兔: Vulture\n\n******WHAT? / 蝦咪*******\nA:A run / 路線：A to A\nS: 7.5 km + Elevation/爬升: 350 m\nL: 9 km + Elevation/爬升: 400 m\n\n*******WHEN / 啥時*******\nDate: Sunday, 16 August 2026\nTime: Hares off at 14:30\n兔子兩點半起跑\n\n*******WHERE / 哪兒*******\nTaiwan POW Memorial and Peace Park (Kinkaseki POW Camp)\n國際終戰和平紀念園區\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/nxEKXFwU2ZdsK6e49\n\n******HOW? / 怎去*******\nZhongxiao Fuxing MRT then Bus #1062 or Banqiao MRT then bus #965\n捷運忠孝復興站然後公車1062，或者捷運板橋站然後公車965\nParking, 停車位：\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/RyNJGdoVKc3qG2ZV7\n\n*******PRICE*******\nMen $250 Women $200\n\n*******BASH / 晚餐*******\nChuen Ji Hall\n金瓜石勸濟堂\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/eR63KCtY5t9PrvZJ9","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"NT$ 250","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmrxxvuw5003804icvayp6n9k","description":"******WHO? / 誰?******\nHare 主兔: The Devil Within\nCohare 副兔: DingBuDong\n\n******WHAT? / 蝦咪*******\nA:B run / 路線：A to B\n9 km + Elevation/爬升: 450 m\n(1km underground so a headlamp is required/1公里在地下，需要帶頭燈）\n\n*******WHEN / 啥時*******\nDate: Sunday, 23 August 2026\nTime: Hares off at 13:30\n兔子一點半起跑\n\n*******WHERE / 哪兒*******\nA:\nFuxing Park\n復興公園\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/bJAjJTNHfxKCrgA99\nB:\n中和市體育會香功委員會華新分會\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/ez2E6SmTC28WLjW37\n\n******HOW? / 怎去*******\nTake the MRT to Nanshijiao then walk to the run start\n捷運南勢角站然後走路到A點\nParking available near Nanshijiao MRT and the B point\n南勢角站或B點有停車位\n\n*******PRICE*******\nMen $250 Women $200\n\n*******BASH / 晚餐*******\n尚介青海鮮熱炒-南勢角\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/zfC6KdsbB6eFwGPA6","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"NT$ 250","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmrxxvuwy003a04icq4wzhxkm","description":"This week, Taipei Metro Hash House Harriers GM Häagen-Dazs is treating us to a run in Bali. She tells us the trail is a homage to her first ever trail race three years ago. Back then, she dragged herself to the finish line, but these days she’s made of tougher stuff. She promises exactly three viewpoints and zero naked hashers. See the hash trash below for more of her plans!\n\n******WHO? / 誰?******\nHare 主兔: Häagen-Dazs\nCohare 副兔: No Hair No Care\n\n******WHAT? / 蝦咪*******\nA:A run / 路線：A to A\nS: TBD\nL: 7.5 km + Elevation/爬升: 550 m\n\n*******WHEN / 啥時*******\nDate: Sunday, 30 August 2026\nTime: Hares off at 14:30\n兔子兩點半起跑\n\n*******WHERE / 哪兒*******\nGuan-Shan Caf’e\n觀山咖啡\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/A3oL3FZdfKtoLP82A\n\n******HOW? / 怎去*******\nTake the MRT to Luzhou Station then bus O20 to Lingyun Temple then walk to the run start\n捷運蘆洲站然後搭公車橘20公車到凌雲寺然後走路到A點\n\n*******PRICE*******\nMen $250 Women $200\n\n*******BASH / 晚餐*******\n碧瑤山莊庭園餐廳\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/yu1nZbiskH43PzoQ8","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"NT$ 250","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
