{"id":"cmsp3981n004904jjyqfga524","description":"Algarve HHH Oktoberfest Hash 2026\n\nWhen: Sunday, 4th October, 13.30 hrs. PROMPT! \n\nWhere: Casa Lontra Bosque, Palmeiros, Salir, 8100-189 Loulé\n\nFor real navigators:\nN 37 deg.13’, 50”\nW 08 deg. 01’,33”\n\nFor stupid Tom-toms and Google Maps :\nN 37.230\nW 08.025\n\nHare: Just Don’t Call Me Shurely\n\nHareline: [redacted] (Hare’s Bitch: Diesel Dyke. Al fresco telephone number: 961 481 309)\n  \nPoint of interest for those who are new to AHHH: Oktoberfest hashes go like this:\n\n1. You HAF to dress up! Zat ist ein order! Herren Hashers are expekted to vear shorts or three-quarter length pants (unless they really own a pair of Lederhosen!) with braces or a waistcoat, a checkered shirt and a wide-brimmed hat (available at all good Chinese Teutonic haberdashers) with a feather in it. Damen Harriets, should they not already possess a dirndl dress, wear pretty gingham (or similar) dresses with aprons or ‘pinnies’ and put their hair in pigtails. Zere vill be a prize for ze best dressed Bavarian.\n2. The whole event has an Oktoberfest theme. Beir vill be German, snacks and food vill be German, the singing vill be German, and the humour vill be . . . vell, jokes about why Donald Trump has no sense of humour. . . ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!\n3. Dogs ist verboten! Sorry, Fido, but for you ze walk ist over!\n4. Oh. Und no pre-teen Hash-brats, either.\n5. If it’s warm, bring swimmies - or go commando like Beep-Beep!\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n\nIf you want to eat, call or email Herr Hare BEFORE HE GETS PISSED ON FRIDAY EVENING. If you don’t you will starve to death in a Stalag!\nEmail: [redacted]\n\nDIRECTIONS:\n\n From the Western Algarve: Come off the N-125 or the A22 at Boliqueime and take the EN270, Loulé, road (north) up into the hills past a quarry. About 250 metres after the quarry there is a road junction signposted ‘Alte, Befafim and Parragil’. Turn left here. \nFollow the road for a kilometre into the village of Parragil. At the T-junction turn left through some useless traffic lights and follow the ","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmsp3982p004b04jjf5c3a5bt","description":"When: Sunday 6th September, 10am for 10.30m start!\n\nWhere: Vilamoura\n\nGPS:  37.109124, -8.151024\n\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/EjMY2njvqXPbzc7aA\n\nHares: Sextiles (& Deep Driller) \n\nRun Fee: Euro 5.00\n\nHareline: 919433123\n\n\n\nInstructions/Information:\n\nA trail so flat, even your excuses won’t have any elevation. Come enjoy a trail where the only thing going uphill is your mood  ;-)\n\nWarning: Dog owners we are walking close to and through bird territory.\n\n\n\nFor the ON ON after, will be at the restaurant La Chamineé, approx.1km from the circle meaning 10m walk or 5m drive.\n\nOrder from the below options and pay individually:\n\nEspetada de gambas\nMista de carne de porco preto\nQueixadas de porco no forno\nPosta de espadarte à algarvia\nVegetarian option - mix Massa e legumes salteados\n\nPlease confirm your attendance and meal selection by Thursday by emailing Sextiles on [redacted]\n\nPS: For the brave ones, we welcome you to take a mergulho into the pool after lunch! 🏊‍♂️☀️😎 \nFeel free to bring a drink or two… just in case the Portuguese sunshine gets the better of you!\n\n\n🚗 Directions – Quarteira/Vilamoura\n\nFrom Tavira:\nA22 → Loulé/Quarteira/Almancil exit → Quarteira/Vilamoura → follow Golf / Estrada de Albufeira → continue on Estrada de Albufeira → destination is in the golf-course area.\n\nFrom Portimão:\nA22 → Loulé/Quarteira/Almancil exit → Quarteira/Vilamoura → follow Golf / Estrada de Albufeira → continue on Estrada de Albufeira → destination is in the golf-course area.\n\nIf you are coming on the N125, head towards Quarteira/Vilamoura. Once you reach Vilamoura, follow the signs for GOLF and Estrada de Albufeira. The destination is in the 8125-507 area.  \n\nIf you see Vilamoura Marina or central Quarteira, you have gone too far!!\n\nAté breve!\n\nON ON!","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmsp3983j004d04jjb3thh5pu","description":"When:  Sunday 20th September, 2pm \n\nWhere: Beep Beep‘s House in Juncais, Alportel, Sao Bras de Alportel\n\nCoordinates: 37.1756660,-7.9161939 or 37°10‘32.4“N, 7°54‘58.3W\n\nHare: Beep Beep\n\nHareline: 914078174\n\n\nInstructions:\n\nAn easy, moderate hilly trail around his house. (Is this correct? He doesn't remember!!)\n\nBring plates and cutlery if you like to eat afterwards\n\nMaybe a chair ? Hare doesn't have enough for everyone!\n\nPlease let the Hare know if you are coming and staying for food by latest Thursday evening, by email on [redacted]\n\n\nDirections:\n\nFind Sao Bras de Alportel and the N2. Travel north, ignoring the restriction and bypass. \n\nReaching Alportel leave the N2 at \"Victorias Cafe“ and go straight into the village center. \n\nAt the Plaza turn sharp left ,pass under the Tunnel direction Juncais.\n\nAfter around 1,5 km or so you find CP840A on your right. Park where you find a suitable place.\n\nON ON!","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmsp3984g004f04jjhl3opr1a","description":"MAMAMARATONA\n\nAHHH as usual supports this great annual cause and we ask you all to try to participate. \n\n Registration is required asap on the Mamaratona website: www.mamamaratona.com.\n\nIf you have problems collecting your shirt and goody bag just let the Hare, Diesel Dyke, know and she will collect them for you. \n\n\"Mamamaratona\" is a prominent charity solidarity race and fitness event held annually in the Algarve region of Portugal.\n\nEvent Overview\nEvent: Mamamaratona 2026\nDate: Sunday, October 18, 2026\nLocation: Jardim Filipe Jonas in Quarteira, Loulé (Algarve, Portugal). Please NOTE new starting place.\n\nPurpose: Part of the global \"Pink October\" (Outubro Rosa) campaign, the event combines physical activity with social solidarity to raise funds and awareness for breast cancer prevention and support oncology patients and their families. \n\nREGISTRATION ON MAMMAMARATONA WEBSITE: www.mamamaratona.com \n\nWE WILL HAVE OUR CIRCLE UP AT 9.30 FOR A 10.00 START.\n\n WE SHALL TRY TO PARK AT THE TOP OF RUA STUTTGART WHERE THERE IS NORMALLY AN ABUNDANCE OF SPACE, EITHER ADJACENT TO THE ROADS AROUND THERE, OR ON THE WASTE GROUND WHICH BACKS THE JARDIM (LOOK OUT FOR THE LITTLE RED SKODA BEER TRUCK).\n\nOUR ON-IN WILL BE AT THE SAME PLACE AND THOSE WHO WANT TO JOIN FOR LUNCH MUST LET THE HARE, DD, KNOW BY 15TH OCTOBER LATEST. RESTAURANT IS SAO MARTINO, ON THE QUARTEIRA SEAFRONT, PEDESTRIAN PART\n\n\nSUBS - €5.00 AND LUNCH OWN BILL. \n\nHARE'S NUMBER IS 961 481 309\nTEMPORARY BEER MONITOR (JDCMS): 966 554 974\n\nOn On!","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
