{"id":"cmss5xjip000304l7qmysp9ai","description":"SH2B #62 (Ironhorse Bash)\nSunday, August 16, 2026\n47.4330347,-121.7688043\n\nGrab your pedal powered crotch rocket, scoot, sled, hog, or Rat bike to join the bash on its annual pilgrimage between Hyak at Snoqualmie Pass and Rattlesnake Lake in North Bend.\n\nJoin us at 11am at Rattlesnake Lake by the Rattlesnake Lake east loop of the lake parking area.  If you have a discover pass use the upper East parking lot as the main lot can get full.  From there we will sort out who has the best bike racks for shuttling the pack up to Hyak where we'll start our ride the Iron Horse back down to the lake.\nFlashlights and at least a light jacket recommended for the tunnel.  Discover pass is needed if you park at the trailhead or Hyak.  Not needed at the lake parking.\n\nHash Cash $5 to make your crotch vibrate.\n\nMessage Shackless if you can help with the shuttle arrangements.\n\n-Shackless\n(William Edward on FB)\n[redacted]","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"$5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmsug5kr7002c04ifgcmbn851","description":"ANNOUNCEMENT\nBad Segeberg is calling. Let's follow the call! Fall in love with a beautifull sight for hashing. Figure out some possibilities to run and drink there!\nOn Saturday 22nd of August.\nWe meet on Hamburg Hauptbahnhof. \nTrain RE8 in direction of Lübeck will leave at 13:06 from Gleis 6A-C. \nRU on? On On !","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":713,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
