{"id":"cmt0is1hg004z04ju8u4kaxdv","description":"When: Monday 24th August, 16.30PM for 17.00 PM THAT’S FIVE PM! \n\nWhere: Igreja da Boa Hora, Parragil\n\nGPS: 37.164337, -8.096451 \n\nWhat Three Words: ///both.twitches.hark \n\nGoogle Maps: https://maps.app.goo.gl/NzQo6p2kWxDvRWw6A\n\nHare: Summer Cummer presents AHHH Run 2181 'Up, Up and Away! (And even more up)'.\n\nHareline: \n\nLost? Nobody cares...but if the hare is sober (not much chance) you could try the 'we don't give a damn' helpline - 918 398 864\n\nInstructions/Information:\n\nYes!! it's hot as hell August so what better way to cool off than to walk many kilometres in cool (much thinner) air! If you crave whinging and moaning, this is the one for you! We’re starting early because the nights are drawing in and you won’t want to get lost in the dark!\n\nWarning: This hash is not for the faint of heart. Or raspberries. Dog owners are reminded that hunting season has just started. We are walking both close to and through hunting territory. \n\nRub a dub dub - who wants grub?: RSVP to [redacted] if you want to be fed AND, if you want to enjoy fine hash cuisine, bring your plate and eating irons or wash your hands first!. \n\nM'Laud will take care of the beers.\n \n\nDirections: \n\nFrom the east, at Bouliqueime, head towards the quarry up the hill. \n\nCross the A22 and wang your way up the N270, turning left just past the horrible quarry on your right (with sensibly closed car windows). \n\nFollow this road until the T-junction. \n\nTurn left here and drive through Parragil until you see the sign on the right for the church on the left.\n\nFrom the west, N270, turn off for Parragil M524-1. \n\nStay on this road until you see the sign on the right for the church on the left. \n\nFrom Tor M524 turning left on the M524-1. \n\nStay on the road until you reach the church on your right.\n \n\nAté breve!\n \n\nON ON!","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
