{"id":"cmt7wj0hp001b04kvtolbsdcy","description":"We're taking our sad group of Belgrade Hashers up to Novi Sad for the day. We will meet at the Belgrade Prokup main train station on Saturday 29th at 11:30am.  Then we can decide if we want the fast 'Soko' train of 33 minutes, or the regular slow train of 50 minutes - which gives us more time to drink on the train.\n\nWhen we arrive in Novi Sad, we'll actually be at Petrovaradin. Gary Fists Patrick will live hare from there to Novi Sad. Or we can take the bus to the center and GFP will live hare from there.  This is a very 'polako' Hash as they say here.\n\nIt's an A to B trail with 3 beer stops and a on-after dinner.  Runners and walkers are together, and probably everyone will walk if the temperature is above 35 degrees. Then we hustle back to Belgrade, unless some sad people get stuck in Novi Sad.","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"RSD 350","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
