{"id":"cmt93evmq003l04l4n0q6o1sq","description":"Hey Hey is returning to hare for the second time with Taiwan Hash House Harriers. His cohare is a surgical nurse he met while working as a hospital janitor: Just Pei-fang. This time, he’s taking us to Tienmu. Sounds tame? Well, Hey Hey promises you’ll get your shoes wet, and likely need medical attention from Just Pei-fang. Read below to find out just how wet you’ll get…\n******WHO? / 誰?******\nHare 主兔: Hey Hey\nCohare 副兔: Just Pei-fang\n******WHAT? / 蝦咪*******\nA:A run / 路線：A to A\nL: 8 km + Elevation/爬升: 380 m\n*******WHEN / 啥時*******\nDate: Sunday, 6 Sep 2026\nTime: Hares off at 14:30\n兔子兩點半起跑\n*******WHERE / 哪兒*******\nZhishanyan Park\n芝山岩文化史蹟公園\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/R4Vq2HXfKddFcJRP6\n******HOW? / 怎去*******\nMRT to Zhishan Station then walk to the run start\n捷運芝山站然後走到A點\n*******PRICE*******\nMen $250 Women $200\n*******BASH / 晚餐*******\n一極鮮熱炒","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"NT$ 250","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
