{"id":"cmuieg9qy000804idggv299xa","description":"SAVE THE DATE 3 Oct 2026: TH3 October trail - is confirmed\n\nLap Dancer will host the trail on 3rd October chez him (151 Route de Seilh, Cornebarrieu) where the trail will start but also finish with BBQ after party\n\nPlease contact [redacted] for exact address\n\nStart 15h00\nArrive: no later than 14h45\nHash cash: 5€\nExtras: bring food for BBQ if you are staying after \n\nT-shirts may be available for sale also if you are interested (depending on availability) : 12€\n\nIf you want to stay for the after party, please consider to contribute food (and maybe additional drinks) for the BBQ\n\nLooking forward to seeing you there\n\nOn on\nLD & GH","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmuk8yb5q004u04jpns1kewu8","description":"When: Sunday 1st November, meet 1.30pm for a 2pm prompt start!\n\nWhere: A Nossa Casa; Bordeira\n\nGoogle Coordinates:  37.12732629325406, -7.925873114086344\n\nHare: Cyclopath\n\nInstructions: \n\nThis is All Saints Day or the Dia Día de los Muertos (Day of the Dead), the day after Halloween, so it's time to visit your dressing up box and come properly attired!! Saints or Sinners, all welcome!!  There will be a prize for the best dressed Hasher!\n\nDoggies allowed on trail and in the courtyard of our Casa.\n\nWe should have enough seating for everyone unless we get inundated!\n\nFood will be provided.  Please let Hare know if you are coming and if you want feeding by emailing:\n[redacted] or What’s app [redacted]\n\nDirections:\n\nWhen you turn into our lane \"Caminho do Ribeiro das Netas\", after the first house on the left is a field for parking, look for signs.\n\nOnce parked, to get into the courtyard of our house go through the gate up the lane 50 m on the right, look for signs. \n\nON ON!","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
