{"id":"cmv09i6xh002y04jkus0uhk6z","description":"Our hare BITW invites you and yours to a travail around Broadbottom. I'm sure there's a joke in there somewhere, but it's far too early for that sort of nonsense.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: We have a non-standard start time. Beano - beware! We are meeting from 13:00, not the usual 14:00. \n\nExpect some shiggy, depending on the weather, so dress appropriately. The nearest station is Broadbottom, and if coming by car there is street parking nearby.\n\n£3 for regulars, free for first timers and kids. Dogs welcome naturally!","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmv09i6yw003004jklttcjvh9","description":"For our first hash of October, Beano will be leading us on a crooked run.\n\nThe venue is The Crooked Man in Prestwich, and as usual we'll meet at 14:00 for a 14:30 start. There is parking fairly close by if you're driving, and plenty of free parking at the Prestwich Metro which is 5 minutes away. For anyone arriving by bus, the 95, 97, 98 and 99 services all stop nearby.\n\nSubs: £3 for regulars, free for first timers and kids.","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
