{"id":"cmvn4glf0002h04l2akhqi99i","description":"HHHey Halfminds,\n\nIt's been 2 years already for Lyon H3. Let's celebrate that analversary by getting drunk at the wine fair once again!!\n\nWhat to expect? Lyon H3 at its best cheapest most incoherent: a short-ish trail where you might or might not see the hare, there might be no beer stop, probably little drinks at circle, ... but free entrance to the Salon des vignerons indépendants and all you can drink wine, bubbly, schnaps at the on-after!! \n\nHere the details :\n\n\nWhen : Sunday November 1st at 11:00 am\n\nWhere : At the big OnlyLyon sign/sculpture, just below the Musée des Confluences, 86 Quai Perrache, 69002 Lyon\n https://maps.app.goo.gl/xmYubW5HNqfEoECG7 \n\nHow to get there : \nTram T1, stop \"Musée des Confluences\" \n\nHare : In-Co-harent +Neglijected\n\nHashcash : 5€\n\nBagdrop : probably not\nA to B run\n \n \nOn after : At about 13:00, we will go the the wine fair (Salon des Vignerons indépendants) at the Halle Tony Garnier, where you get a wine glass, and then can wander around (no trail marked!) and taste wine, but also bubbly, liqueurs, etc...","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
