{"id":"cmw50npni000b2jhnc6hlrwwx","description":"Badger Ale and Craft beers ...Sunday roast also available.\n\nOption 1...train to Wandsworth Town Station, then the 44 bus (Stop AA)...then a short walk.\nOption 2. Train to Clapham Junction, then a 15 min walk to the pub.\n\nDS....hot mulled wine and mince pies. \nBag drop: boot of hare's car\nRSVP requested by Saturday morning.","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmw50nprm000d2jhnz19wqbte","description":"Northfields Station is in Zone 3 on the Piccadilly Line\n\nThe hare promises a \"shorter run\" as this is post CLaWs Christmas Party.","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
