{"id":"cmw50nq40000j2jhns3er74rw","description":"There will be a p-trail from Ealing Broadway station. It's the same pub that we used for the WLH3 Boxing Day trail but not necessarily the same route. They have a Thai kitchen that day.","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmw50nq7t000l2jhnpx2ygbm0","description":"Nearest station: Goldhawk Road in Zone 2 on the Circle and Hammersmith + City Line","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmw50nqbu000n2jhnypv4n7ql","description":"We can leave bags in the pub, but don't bring anything valuable. Pub is adjacent to South Kenton Station, which is on Bakerloo Line and Overground. Bus 223 stops outside the pub as well.","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmw50nqg0000p2jhnrp0omha7","description":"There is a back garden, as they call it, and there were three ales at £5.60 a pint, so it could be worse.","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmw50nqk1000r2jhngetgg6vd","description":"Nearest tube station is Sloane Square (District and Circle Lines) from which a P-trail will be laid. Bring your camera for photo opportunities. \nThe pub is a small freehouse that is popular for its Sunday Roasts. Space is limited and so if you want to dine there, you are recommended to arrive early (pub opens at 12:00) and make it known that you wish to dine.\n\nAs usual. advance notification of intended participation would be welcomed so as to ensure sufficient liquid refreshment can be supplied.","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
