{"id":"cmw50oapx0001llhnbibubkgp","description":"Meeting Time: 14:45 with a start time of 15:00 sharp(ish)\n\nRun Type: A-A (start and finish at the same spot)\n\nDistance: 8-12km (runners), 5-6km (walkers)\n\nLocation: Squeaky Rider and Noisy Pussy’s humble abode in Quinton (B32 1LH, intersection of Higgins Lane and Ridgacre Lane)\n\nPrice: £5 (Covers 2 beers or softies with some snacks. If you want extra beer, bring your own with your name on it and we’ll put it in the cooler).\n\nAll hashes will be £5/run plus a one time annual membership fee to cover supplies (you’ll understand after your first run). We’ll post more info about the annual fee (cheap we promise!) after a final bit of soberish maths.\n\nDinner at a local Indian restaurant for the On After (not included in hash cash).","street":null,"loc":null,"cost":"£5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
