{"id":"cmqzl4tfa00075vhnxa7qivhu","old_md5":"4a520a3f0dd4fcebf36cf4f4f4571510","description":"FOLLOW COVID REGULATIONS​\nCONTACT TRACING WILL BE IN PLACE​\nSCAN QR CODE, TEMPERATURE CHECK AND DISINFECT HANDS ON ARRIVAL​\n遵守所有防疫規定​\n將採取實名制​\n報到時請掃QR Code，量測體溫以及消毒你的雙手​\n\n******WHAT?*******​\nWith the new mask restrictions landing in Taoyuan we've decided to postpone Mijo Slut and Rocketman's run until we can enjoy it in the full glory of facial nakedness that we've come to enjoy of late.​\n因應桃園最新防疫政策公布，我們也決定延後舉行米酒俗辣與火箭人的跑跑直到確認我們可以盡情享受正臉全裸的那一天。\n\nBull's Eye and Lara Crotch to the rescue! They've kindly moved their run up a week, so come and join us for a mountain side run far away from all those sickly pilots. Come frolic around the tea fields and gulp down some fresh mountain air followed by some cold beer. There are sure to be views and trails aplenty.​\n前來支援收銀的是Bull's Eye 及 Lara Crotch！他們慷慨的將規劃路線提前一週，帶我們遠離酷酷嫂的機師們到山邊進行一個跑步的動作，愜意地徜徉在茶園間，大口呼吸新鮮的偽谷關空氣，佐以冰鎮的啤酒，保證有美妙的景色與路線！\n\n​If you reach in to Bull's Eye's pockets on Sunday and have a rummage around, you can also lay your fingers on a brand new commemorative patch he has produced to mark the start of TwH3 in 2022. Just be careful what else you find in there.​\n本週日如果你伸進 Bull's Eye的口袋裡翻找，可能會找到一個他在2022為了Taiwan Hash製作的全新燙印徽章，要小心摸到其他不明物體就是了。\n\n​*******WHEN*******​\nDate: Sunday, January 9th, 2022​\nTime: 13:45​\nThe Hares are off at 14:00​\n兔子兩點起跑!!​\n\n​*******WHERE*******​\n​Spring Tea County\nNo. 30, Lane 38, Section 3, Zhinan Rd, Wenshan District, Taipei City, 116\n[redacted]\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/Djv7SzNbzNbhtAnD8\n\n春茶鄉\n[redacted]\n116台北市文山區指南路三段38巷30號​\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/Djv7SzNbzNbhtAnD8\n\n******HOW?*******​\nTake the Maokong Gondola or bus from Taipei Zoo. Just Google it will you?​\n\nDrivers there is parking.​\n\n怎麼去：\n從動物園站搭乘貓空纜車或公車，然後，善用Google就對了。\n\n駕車者，有位可停。\n\n*******PRICE*******​\nMen $250​\nWomen $200​\n\n*******BASH*******​\nBash at the run start\n\n​*******COVID*******\nUse hand sanitizer before giving the hash cash money.\n請在給Hash Cash前先消毒你的手\nIf you are at all worried about COVID-19 then stay home.\n如果你擔心病毒問題，請你待在家裡不要來\nIf you are a higher risk demographic please stay home.\n如果你是高風險族群，請你待在家裡不要來\nThis is for your safety and you can attend at your own risk.\n這攸關你的安全及健康，請自我斟酌負責是否來參加\n*******Dick Check*******\nAlthough we want you to have fun on the party bus and other hash events, remember that you being drunk isn’t an invitation to grope, harass someone or generally be a dick. Any inappropriate behavior will be met with an immediate 1 year ban from all Taiwan Hash events regardless of your gender and sexual orientation. We’re here to have fun and that’s it! Just remember, think about your mother before you act, that should get rid of your horn\n*給全部跑友的提醒*\n我們希望大家都在聚會和派對上玩得開心，但請注意，就算喝醉也不代表你可以隨意去摸來摸去、騷擾別人或是變成一個混蛋。當我們發現有任何不適當的行為發生，不論你的性別或性向是如何，我們將馬上禁止你一年內不得再來TwH3聚會或派對! 請記住，我們來TwH3開心的，請大家三思而後行!\n*******Disclaimer*******\n1- First time runners! Bring a change, set of clean clothes and shoes. Trail might be muddy, crossing rivers may happen, and hares are responsible if it is raining. (Blame them during the down-downs)\n2- hashers bringing first time runners, please, be in charge to babysit them along the trail.\n3- It is recommended to 1st Time runners to bring their cellphone on the trail.\n4- This is a running event, it may include trails, climbing, snakes … runners are informed they are RESPONSIBLE for their OWN safety. Late Walkers/Runners will be rescued if missing at the finish line…\n5- Eat before joining to avoid low blood sugar\n6- this event is including alcoholic beverages, please be responsible and don’t drive\n1- 第一次來參加的兔友們，請攜帶更換的衣服及鞋子。路線可能會泥濘，也有可能會穿越一些河。如果下雨的話，就怪兔子吧(你可以在down down時唸他們一下)!!\n2- 帶第一次來跑的兔友們，請自行負責照顧你的朋友!\n3- 我們建議第一次來跑的朋友們，帶著你的手機一起跑，以備不時之需\n4- 這是一個跑山的活動，這代表會有未開發的小徑、攀岩、蛇等等，參加者自行對自身安全負責。遲到或是走比較慢的兔友，我們如果發現你沒回到終點，我們會去找你。\n5- 參加此活動前，請確保你來之前吃些東西，避免低血糖血壓狀況發生\n6- 這是一個提供酒精飲料的活動，喝酒不開車，開車不喝酒"},
{"id":"cmqzl4tor000b5vhn3b6gb0xg","old_md5":"b5a7871183e9309f16a4f0996387cd02","description":"FOLLOW COVID REGULATIONS \nCONTACT TRACING WILL BE IN PLACE \nSCAN QR CODE, TEMPERATURE CHECK AND DISINFECT HANDS ON ARRIVAL \n遵守所有防疫規定 \n將採取實名制 \n報到時請掃QR Code，量測體溫以及消毒你的雙手 \n\n******WHAT?******* \nDump and Run and Period had been partying hard for a long, long time. By the time the nineties rolled round there was only one possible way to reverse the years of damage they had inflicted on their bodies - the mythical fountain of youth. Legend has it that anyone who drinks or bathes in its waters will have their youth restored. For years they scoured the world, searching every beach, brothel and mountain. Finally, they made it to Taiwan and the Beitou hot springs. \nDump and Run 和 Period已經趴踢好長一段時間了，遠在九零年代彼時只有一個方式可以修復他們摧殘多年的身軀 - 神秘的青春之泉，傳說飲用或以此泉水沐浴將可回春。多年來，他們跑遍世界，在各海灘，妓院和山林中尋找，終於，在台灣北投溫泉找到了。\n\nThe friends stripped, looked each other in the eye and jumped in... The results are self-evident. Nothing happened. Another dud - or so they thought. Period and Dump and Run felt a strange stirring in their loins, a sensation neither had felt in many moons. And an awkward silence fell over the pair. What the hell was going on? Then The Root of All Evil hopped in. “Ha ha don’t be embarrassed - you’ve discovered the Fountain of Sexual Youth!”\n兩人打赤膊，看了彼此一眼後跳下去...最後結果不言自明，什麼也沒發生。他們以為這是另一個山寨泉水。Dump and Run 及 Period 卻突然感覺到下面一股腫脹與攪動，一種好久沒有的港覺...接著一陣尷尬的沈默籠罩著袒裎相見的兩人，到底發生什麼事？撒旦此時出現：「哈哈不要害羞，你們找到的是，青春之泉性愛版！」\n\nThis Sunday the run will be 7-8Km of Beitou hills, great scenery, views, runnable trails and agriculture and a smattering of volcanism. After the run they will share the secret of the mythical hot spring waters with you. They have a fantastically good deal worked out with the owners:\n\n#### You can bash (food and beer) + enjoy the hot springs for the ludicrously cheap price of 200 NTD, BUT – You MUST sign up in advance. ####\n\nhttps://forms.gle/h1zLWdUDaicWAdYLA\nIf you don’t register before Saturday night, you won’t be able to stay for bash or hot spring spa. \n\nYou cannot sign up at the run on Sunday.\n\nIf you only want to bash (no hot spring) you MUST still sign up in before Saturday night (1/15) using this form: https://forms.gle/h1zLWdUDaicWAdYLA\n\nBash and hot spring spa sign-up: https://forms.gle/h1zLWdUDaicWAdYLA\n\n本週日在北投山丘上的跑7-8K，漂亮的風景與展望，好跑的路及田間，有時還有點火山活動。跑後他們將分享神秘泉水，他們與撒旦談成了一個極好的優惠：\n\n#### 跑後聚餐（晚餐與啤酒）＋青春之泉（泡湯）超激優惠 $200元，但注意，必須先登記，必須先登記，必須先登記！####\n\n如果你想聚餐也想泡湯：\n週六（1/15）23:59前完成報名登記，否則將無法參加！\nhttps://forms.gle/h1zLWdUDaicWAdYLA\n\n如你只想聚餐不想泡湯：\n同樣須提前於週六（1/15）23:59前使用同連結中表格完成報名登記：https://forms.gle/h1zLWdUDaicWAdYLA\n\n週日（1/16) 不開放現場報名！\n週日（1/16) 不開放現場報名！\n週日（1/16) 不開放現場報名！\n\n如果登記參加卻未出席，仍需支付$200元泡湯及晚餐費用。\n\n*******WHEN******* \nDate: Sunday, January 16th 2022 \nTime: 13:45 \nThe Hares are off at 14:00 \n兔子兩點起跑!! \n\n*******WHERE*******\nNo. 7之1號, Hudi Rd, Beitou District, Taipei City, 112\nNo. 7之1號, Hudi Rd, Beitou District 112台北市北投區湖底路7之1號 Qi Ku Wenquan Restaurant [redacted] https://goo.gl/maps/yVhhJq4PChTbzned9\n\n******HOW?******* \n1pm Taxi Pool from Shipai MRT on the red line. There are two buses from Shipai MRT station, 128, and little 36, Exit bus at Shamao Bridge and follow flour. Drivers can follow flour from Shamao Bridge\nDrivers there is parking. \n\n怎麼去：\n1pm 從淡水線（紅線）石牌捷運站拼車或搭128及小36公車在紗帽橋下車後跟著麵粉走。\n開車者亦可自紗帽橋跟著麵粉開，起跑點有停車位。\n\n*******PRICE******* \nMen $250 \nWomen $200 \n\n*******BASH******* \n##You MUST sign up in advance##\nBash at the run start – If you sign up in advance, you can bash (food and beer) + enjoy the hot springs for the ludicrously cheap price of 200 NTD. https://forms.gle/h1zLWdUDaicWAdYLA\n\n跑後聚餐在起跑點，於提前週六（1/15）23:59前使用以下連結中表格完成報名登記：https://forms.gle/h1zLWdUDaicWAdYLA\n\n週日（1/16) 不開放現場報名！\n週日（1/16) 不開放現場報名！\n週日（1/16) 不開放現場報名！\n\n如果登記參加卻未出席，仍需支付$200元泡湯及晚餐費用。\n\n*******COVID*******\nUse hand sanitizer before giving the hash cash money.\n請在給Hash Cash前先消毒你的手\nIf you are at all worried about COVID-19 then stay home.\n如果你擔心病毒問題，請你待在家裡不要來\nIf you are a higher risk demographic please stay home.\n如果你是高風險族群，請你待在家裡不要來\nThis is for your safety and you can attend at your own risk.\n這攸關你的安全及健康，"},
{"id":"cmqzl4vdu00115vhn482wfimg","old_md5":"c0c55108fb7be8a1df4bffe566e87a2a","description":"#2444 – The 69 of Fire Run\n\n\nFOLLOW COVID REGULATIONS CONTACT TRACING WILL BE IN PLACE SCAN QR CODE, TEMPERATURE CHECK AND DISINFECT HANDS ON ARRIVAL \n\n遵守所有防疫規定 將採取實名制 報到時請掃QR Code，量測體溫以及消毒你的雙手\n\n\n******WHAT?******* \n\nA:A run, 6.5km/350 m elevation\n\n路線：A to A (6.5k爬升350)\n\n\nHare: Maybe\n\nCohare: Firebird Junior\n\n\nBack in the day our co-hare was a horny young scamp with nothing better to do on a Sunday than to run the hash. On his first run he spotted the girl of his dreams and then he set about impressing her as only a hasher could - He drank a lot of beer, he exposed too much flesh and finally she succumbed to his wily charms as they performed a 69 (at down downs).\n想當年兔子還是個精蟲衝腦血氣方剛的小夥子，周日如果不跑hash只能回家盯著牆壁。而他，就在第一次跑hash遇見了他的夢中情人，還為了引起她的注意使出身為一個hasher的第101招，喝到酒空搭配公然裸露，終於，在吐槽大會69的時候，她拜倒在他不確定有沒有穿裙子的雕兒下。\n\nJoin us next Sunday as 10 years later he and his wife Maybe are back to celebrate the 69 that sealed the deal – the 69 of Fire. It is also an occasion to mark the hare’s birthday, 10 years of happy marriage and to remember those good old days when they first met on the China Hash. \n本週日，兔子與他的妻子Maybe將強勢回歸重溫當年的定情儀式- 火之69。同時也將一同慶祝副兔的生日、十年的美滿婚姻以及回味他們在China Hash的初相遇。\n\nThe run is easy to get to and the climax of a week of haring for this happy couple. They will hare in the same area on Wednesday for MH3 and again on Sunday. What doesn’t say 'I love you' like finding two different runs together and then drinking a whole load of beer?\n本次路線很容易到達，也是這對佳偶本週的高潮（他們在週三也會在同個區域為MH3做路）。有什麼比一起做兩條路然後喝到爆更能表達愛老虎油？\n\n\n*******WHEN******* \n\nDate: Sunday, April 10th 2022 \nTime: Hares off at 14:30 \n兔子兩點半起跑!!\n\n\n*******WHERE*******\n\nThe run start will be at Yongchunpi Ecological Wetland Park \n永春坡生態濕地公園\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/TaAvPXsgTeR22up67\n\n\n******HOW?******* \n\nTake the MRT to Yongchun and walk 1.3 km (20 minutes) to the run start. Follow the flour from exit 4. There is a Youbike station nearby in Linkou park.\n\n\nDrivers: There is some paid parking 1km from the run start. https://goo.gl/maps/ZKkPASZva5oQ8WNM7\n\n怎麼去：\n捷運藍線永春站四號出口跟著麵粉步行1.3公里（20分鐘）至起跑點。附近的林口公園亦有Youbike站。\n\n起跑點1公里處有付費停車場。\n\n*******PRICE******* \n\nMen $250 Women $200\n\n\n*******BASH******* \n\n第一鮮生猛現撈現炒\n[redacted] \nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/ySPbMxYnV6MkXyvy7\n\n\n*******COVID******* \n\nUse hand sanitizer before giving the hash cash money. \n請在給Hash Cash前先消毒你的手 \n\nIf you are at all worried about COVID-19 then stay home. \n如果你擔心病毒問題，請你待在家裡不要來 \n\nIf you are a higher risk demographic please stay home. \n如果你是高風險族群，請你待在家裡不要來 \n\nThis is for your safety and you can attend at your own risk. \n這攸關你的安全及健康，請自我斟酌負責是否來參加\n\n\n*******Dick Check******* \n\nAlthough we want you to have fun on the party bus and other hash events, remember that you being drunk isn’t an invitation to grope, harass someone or generally be a dick. Any inappropriate behavior will be met with an immediate 1 year ban from all Taiwan Hash events regardless of your gender and sexual orientation. We’re here to have fun and that’s it! Just remember, think about your mother before you act, that should get rid of your horn \n\n*給全部跑友的提醒* 我們希望大家都在聚會和派對上玩得開心，但請注意，就算喝醉也不代表你可以隨意去摸來摸去、騷擾別人或是變成一個混蛋。當我們發現有任何不適當的行為發生，不論你的性別或性向是如何，我們將馬上禁止你一年內不得再來TwH3聚會或派對! 請記住，我們來TwH3開心的，請大家三思而後行!\n\n\n*******Disclaimer******* \n\n1- First time runners! Bring a change, set of clean clothes and shoes. Trail might be muddy, crossing rivers may happen, and hares are responsible if it is raining. (Blame them during the down-downs) \n2- hashers bringing first time runners, please, be in charge to babysit them along the trail. \n3- It is recommended to 1st Time runners to bring their cellphone on the trail. \n4- This is a running event, it may include trails, climbing, snakes … runners are informed they are RESPONSIBLE for their OWN safety. Late Walkers/Runners will be rescued if missing at the finish line… \n5- Eat before joining to avoid low blood sugar \n6- this event is including alcoholic beverages, please be responsible and don’t drive \n\n1- 第一次來參加的兔友們，請攜帶更換的衣服及鞋子。路線可能會泥濘，也有可能會穿越 一些河。如果下雨的話，就怪兔子吧(你可以在down down時唸他"},
{"id":"cmqzl4way001f5vhnvjaf4agp","old_md5":"ab85032c9428ecc4686f74a666fb4d1e","description":"FOLLOW COVID REGULATIONS: TEMPERATURE CHECK AND DISINFECT HANDS ON ARRIVAL\n遵守所有防疫規定 ，量測體溫以及消毒你的雙手\n\n******WHAT?*******\nA:A run, Short 6km 200m elevation & Long 11km 400m elevation\n路線：A to A, Short: 6k爬升200 & Long: 11k爬升400.\n\n\nHare: The Leash\nCohare: Tommy Liu\n\nNever judge a hasher by their hash name, a book by its cover or a hare by the bulges in their flour bags, so the old saying goes. \n自古有言，汝切勿以貌取人、以兔名賤跑者、以麵粉袋識兔子。\n\nSo, we must ask ourselves – have we been wrong about next week’s hare all these years? Is it in fact The Leash who has been on the leash recently? With Dr Binglang finally packed off to ‘Straya I reckon we’re going to find out - when the Dr’s away, mamma’s gonna play! – The Leash is going to be OFF THE LEASH!! \n所以，我們得好好捫心自問，這些年來是不是都誤會了本周的兔子？Dr. Binglang終於出發去了澳洲(前情提要請見第2445次跑跑)，估計我們終於要見證老公不在家，老娘怎麼玩！－The Leash脫韁啦！\n\nSo, watch out Taiwan Hash, the Formosa Hash GM is on the party warpath – this Sunday there’s going to be typically glorious trails, white wine and beer galore BUT because of the crappy weather there won’t actually be a white sandy beach by the sea…. will a duck pond do instead? You already know who to blame anyway and it’s certainly not going to stop the hares running in their bikinis.\n所以啦你各位台灣健龍跑者們，要知道芙爾摩莎跑山俱樂部(Formosa Hash)會長現正趴踢中，也正在去趴踢的路上－本周日會有必備的超讚路線和滿載的白酒和啤酒，就差白沙海灘了！可惜因為天氣蕭爛，所以只能先以池塘將就啦！總之你知道是誰的錯，但這也不會阻止兔子們穿比基尼的。\n\nJudging also by the leaked FH3 photos that I’ve discovered circulating on the dark web – there’s likely to be wild down-downs, (semi-)optional nudity and finger food. There could be raucous singing, high-heels on trail and a lot of drunkenness, who really knows? Join us this week to find out.\n從我在黑網上閒晃時發現的芙爾摩莎外流照片中看起來，本周日貌似會有狂野的吐槽大會、假自願真強迫的裸露以及一些小點心，可能會有喧鬧的歌聲、有人可能會穿高跟鞋跑、也有可能你各位會變成醉後大丈夫，誰知道呢？加入我們一起探索吧。\n\n*******WHEN*******\nDate: Sunday, May 22nd 2022\nTime: Hares off at 14:30\n兔子兩點半起跑!!\n\n\n*******WHERE*******\nThe Indigenous People's Park in Shilin – right by The National Palace Museum \nSec 2, Zhi Shan Rd, Shilin District, Taipei City, 111\n\n\n原住民文化主題公園\n[redacted]\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/ZdSLL5fDEZiM6oGZ9\n******HOW?*******\nTake any bus to National Palace Museum from MRT Shilin station, then 4 mins walk.\nThere’s also a YouBike 2.0 station in the park: YouBike 2.0\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/LmLQsvr8hmp8mvuX9\n\n\n怎麼去\n士林捷運站搭乘任一台往故宮的公車，下車後步行4分鐘。還有YouBike2.0 點 YouBike 2.0\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/LmLQsvr8hmp8mvuX9\n\n*******PRICE*******\n\nMen $250 Women $200\n\n*******BASH*******\nWe want to do our part to help limit the spread of Covid so there is no bash organised by TwH3. If you decide to go and eat dinner together, that’s on you. Stay safe.\n我們想要盡一己棉薄之力阻絕散播武漢肺炎，所以台灣健龍近期將不會舉辦跑後聚餐。如果你各位決定一起吃飯，請自行負責，祝平安。\n\n*******COVID*******\nUse hand sanitizer before giving the hash cash money.\n請在給Hash Cash前先消毒你的手\nIf you are at all worried about COVID-19 then stay home.\n如果你擔心病毒問題，請你待在家裡不要來\nIf you are a higher risk demographic please stay home.\n如果你是高風險族群，請你待在家裡不要來\nThis is for your safety and you can attend at your own risk.\n這攸關你的安全及健康，請自我斟酌負責是否來參加\n\n*******Dick Check*******\nAlthough we want you to have fun on the party bus and other hash events, remember that you being drunk isn’t an invitation to grope, harass someone or generally be a dick. Any inappropriate behavior will be met with an immediate 1 year ban from all Taiwan Hash events regardless of your gender and sexual orientation. We’re here to have fun and that’s it! Just remember, think about your mother before you act, that should get rid of your horn.\n*給全部跑友的提醒* 我們希望大家都在聚會和派對上玩得開心，但請注意，就算喝醉也不代表你可以隨意去摸來摸去、騷擾別人或是變成一個混蛋。當我們發現有任何不適當的行為發生，不論你的性別或性向是如何，我們將馬上禁止你一年內不得再來TwH3聚會或派對! 請記住，我們來TwH3開心的，請大家三思而後行!\n\n*******Disclaimer*******\n1- First time runners! Bring a change, set of clean clothes and shoes. Trail might be muddy, crossing rivers may happen, and hares are responsible if it is raining. (Blame them during the down-downs)\n2- hashers bringing first time runners, please, be in charge to babysit them along the trail.\n3- It is recommended to 1st Time runners to bring their cellphone on the tra"},
{"id":"cmqzl4wg4001h5vhnhwhz8gf2","old_md5":"42da5c835caafc19a136a0baf9ccd7e3","description":"FOLLOW COVID REGULATIONS: TEMPERATURE CHECK AND DISINFECT HANDS ON ARRIVAL\n遵守所有防疫規定 ，量測體溫以及消毒你的雙手\n\n******WHAT?*******\nA:A run, 8.5km 165m elevation \n路線：A to A, 8.5km 爬升165\n\nHare: Dr Vagina Face\nCohare: Flacid (軟男)\n\n\nIt was a Friday night and Dr Vagina Face had the horn. After finishing the bash, he headed home and a perverted scheme crept into his mind. He logged in to the university’s high-powered radio-telescope and began to train the lenses toward the bright lights of Taoyuan city. But before he could properly finish the task in hand, his vision blurred, and he slumped face first to the keyboard. \n一個周五夜黑風高的夜晚， Dr. Vagina Face感到一陣焦躁難耐，聚餐結束返家後，一個小奸小惡的念頭在他腦中萌芽，他登入大學的高功率電波望遠鏡然後調整鏡頭轉向燈火通明的桃園市。但就在他即將完成任務之際，突然感到一陣視線模糊，臉朝下倒在鍵盤上。\n\n\nThe next morning, he woke with a guilty jolt. He began gently peeling his tongue from the crusted spacebar, and rolled his eyes upwards to examine the blinking screen:\nAnomalies found: 1/ Distance 207,005, 987 km/ Size: 100,000 square meters / Composition: 92% Iron, 6% Gold, 2% Cheese.\n隔天早上他帶著罪惡感醒來，一邊把黏在空白鍵盤上的舌頭拔起，一邊揉揉眼睛看向閃爍著的螢幕－發現異物質：距離207,005, 987公里/ 規模100,000平方米/ 92%鐵、6%金、2%起司組成。\n\n\nMmm hmmm gmmm, hmm! He tapped his name into the NASA online registry of space objects and bingo - asteroid EL-0N-[redacted]-X was his! For an exciting moment, the future seemed very rosy. \n轟隆...轟隆...轟轟轟隆! 他在NASA太空物體註冊網站輸入自己的名字搜尋然後賓果! 一籠馬濕嗑捌洞洞捌拐參伍伍-叉小行星是他的了! 在那一瞬間，他感到未來充滿了一片光明。\n\n\nThe next day things started getting weird, a single piece of biltong arrived with a simple demand etched into it: SELL ME THE SPACE ROCK. All the local farmers in Taoyuan began investing in dangerous guard dogs and driving Teslas, the local bash restaurants all closed. Before 8am every day, all the beer in every local 7-eleven had been bought and poured into the river. \n但就在隔天，事情開始變得怪異，首先他收到一塊乾肉條，上面寫著簡單的指示：小行星倘賣嘸? 所有桃園當地的農民們開始豢養兇猛的看門狗，開著特斯拉，當地餐廳全部暫停營業。每天早上八點以前，每家便利商店的啤酒全被買走然後倒進河裡。\n\n\nDr Vagina Face faced a choice - A future as a sad billionaire but unable to hash, or to sell his space rock to the mystery South African at a knock down price. He chose the hash! – and with the money bought and disposed of all the farm dogs in the Taoyuan metro area. \nDr. Vagina Face面臨了一個難題－是要成為一個哀傷且無法跑hash的億萬富翁，或是賤賣他的小行星給一個神祕南非投資客? 他選了hash!- 然後他把得到的錢將所有桃園機捷站附近的看門狗全部買來放生。\n\n\nThe trails in Shanbi are outstanding so don’t miss out as we celebrate our hare’s generosity this Sunday. There will be verdant fields, rolling hills, great views, and possibly a few dogs. If you’re scared of dogs don’t worry - the hares are kindly sponsoring a special memorial safety rock for each runner.\n本週日在山鼻站的路線非常棒所以千萬別錯過了慷慨的兔子為我們做的路，會有青翠的田野風光，起伏的小山丘，美好的風景，可能還會有一些狗，但是怕狗人士免驚! 兔子為各位準備了特別有紀念性的石頭給各位帶著防身。\n\n\n*******WHEN*******\nDate: Sunday, May 29th 2022\nTime: Hares off at 14:30\n兔子兩點半起跑!!\n\n\n*******WHERE*******\nShanbi\nMeetup at the farmhouse restaurant: \n機捷山鼻站, 在大排檔居酒屋 佳園復古餐廳會合:\n\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/BtVd1nZ2U9PXSxNK9\n\n******HOW?*******\nAirport MRT A10 Shanbi and walk 5 minutes.\nYouBike from Bali for the chronically masochistic.\nDrivers – there’s loads of free parking.\n怎麼去: \n正常人- 機捷 A10 山鼻站步行五分鐘\n受虐狂- 從八里Youbike\n駕車者- 很多停車位\n\n*******PRICE*******\nMen $250 Women $200\n\n*******BASH*******\nWe want to do our part to help limit the spread of Covid so there is no bash organised by TwH3. If you decide to go and eat dinner together, that’s on you. Stay safe.\n我們想要盡一己棉薄之力阻絕散播武漢肺炎，所以台灣健龍近期將不會舉辦跑後聚餐。如果你各位決定一起吃飯，請自行負責，祝平安。\n\n*******COVID*******\nUse hand sanitizer before giving the hash cash money.\n請在給Hash Cash前先消毒你的手\nIf you are at all worried about COVID-19 then stay home.\n如果你擔心病毒問題，請你待在家裡不要來\nIf you are a higher risk demographic please stay home.\n如果你是高風險族群，請你待在家裡不要來\nThis is for your safety and you can attend at your own risk.\n這攸關你的安全及健康，請自我斟酌負責是否來參加\n\n*******Dick Check*******\nAlthough we want you to have fun on the party bus and other hash events, remember that you being drunk isn’t an invitation to grope, harass someone or generally be a dick. Any inappropriate behavior will be met with an immediate 1 year ban from all"},
{"id":"cmqzl4wpw001l5vhneoq08kfm","old_md5":"a19f957bf3efdae615da55dceb0503ab","description":"FOLLOW COVID REGULATIONS: TEMPERATURE CHECK AND DISINFECT HANDS ON ARRIVAL\n遵守所有防疫規定 ，量測體溫以及消毒你的雙手\n\n******WHAT?*******\nA:A run, \nShort: 6.5 km 280m elevation. \nLong: 7-8 km 280m elevation. \n\n路線：A to A\n\nHare: Mr Potato Head\nCohare: Durex\n\nYears ago next week’s hares were spending a sunny afternoon by the river. They had prepared a huge jug of chilled pina colada cocktail and were ready to soak up some rays. Shortly after the first drops had passed their lips, Durex noticed something strange. Mr Potato Head started to look a little more teenage, and a little green.\n多年前本周的兔子在一個河邊享受著和煦的午後，他們帶了一大壺的鳳梨調酒正準備要吸收一些紫外線，正當他們嘗了幾口，Durex感到有點不對勁，Mr. Potato Head則看起來看些年輕, 有些...綠。\n\n“Dude what’s up with your face?” \n“Far-out, you totally look 10 years younger”\n“Bodacious!”\n＂欸你的臉發生什麼事？＂\n＂我的老天鵝啊，你看起來年輕了十歲欸！＂\n＂噁妹進！＂\n\nThings only got stranger, they started to develop strange American accents, a craving for pizza and scaly skin… \n但事情越發怪異，他們開始操起美國口音，還很想吃披薩，皮膚變得乾裂...\n\nA quick Google later, they discovered the source of the changes. A mad pineapple farmer in Kaohsiung had been lacing his pineapples with an experimental fertilizer. When combined with ice made of water from the Guishan area and coconut milk, the radioactive pineapple juice started to change their DNA. The Teenage Mutant Hashing Turtles were born.\n迅速的姑狗了一下，他們發現了起因，一個高雄的鳳梨農使用了一種實驗性的肥料，當使用龜山區域的水源製作的冰塊結合搭配椰奶，食用這個具有放射性的鳳梨調酒將改變人的DNA，變種龜少年誕生了。\n\nLuckily these guys are hashers. Instinctively they knew what to do. They threw on their shoes, ran 8km around the local trails and swiftly sank 10 cans of beer each. Of course, this is the only cure for looking that green and hungover. Happily buzzed and relieved to be looking less green and scaly, the two relaxed back in to the water to complete the end of their treatment - chilling in the awesome swimming hole that will be the end to this Sunday’s trail.\n還好這些人是跑者啊，他們立刻知道該怎麼做了，套上運動鞋，在鄰近區域大跑8公里，然後各自灌下十罐啤酒。想也知道，這是對付宿醉跟一臉綠光的唯一解方。不再那麼綠，不再那麼乾裂後，他們終於鬆了一口氣，繼續完成最後一道療程－泡在路線最後的池子裡游泳。\n\nCheck out the pictures, you’re going to be jealous if you miss this one!\n快看看本次路線的照片啊，錯過可惜！\n\nCowabunga!\n\n*******WHEN*******\nDate: Sunday, June 12th 2022\nTime: Hares off at 14:30\n兔子兩點半起跑!!\n\n*******WHERE*******\nNear Guishan station , Genfeng, Yilan\n近宜蘭縣頭城鎮礁溪鄉之龜山火車站。\n\n北關海鮮城 -(人氣排隊餐廳、家庭桌菜 聚餐推薦、新鮮活海產必吃)\n[redacted]\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/giDuRzBALfzGajrm8\n\n\n******HOW?*******\nTake the train to Guishan Station and follow the flour.\n搭乘台鐵至龜山站並跟著麵粉走。\n\n*******PRICE*******\nMen $250 Women $200\n\n*******BASH*******\nWe want to do our part to help limit the spread of Covid so there is no bash organised by TwH3. If you decide to go and eat dinner together, that’s on you. Stay safe.\n我們想要盡一己棉薄之力阻絕散播武漢肺炎，所以台灣健龍近期將不會舉辦跑後聚餐。如果你各位決定一起吃飯，請自行負責，祝平安。\n\n*******COVID*******\nUse hand sanitizer before giving the hash cash money.\n請在給Hash Cash前先消毒你的手\nIf you are at all worried about COVID-19 then stay home.\n如果你擔心病毒問題，請你待在家裡不要來\nIf you are a higher risk demographic please stay home.\n如果你是高風險族群，請你待在家裡不要來\nThis is for your safety and you can attend at your own risk.\n這攸關你的安全及健康，請自我斟酌負責是否來參加\n\n*******Dick Check*******\nAlthough we want you to have fun on the party bus and other hash events, remember that you being drunk isn’t an invitation to grope, harass someone or generally be a dick. Any inappropriate behavior will be met with an immediate 1 year ban from all Taiwan Hash events regardless of your gender and sexual orientation. We’re here to have fun and that’s it! Just remember, think about your mother before you act, that should get rid of your horn.\n*給全部跑友的提醒* 我們希望大家都在聚會和派對上玩得開心，但請注意，就算喝醉也不代表你可以隨意去摸來摸去、騷擾別人或是變成一個混蛋。當我們發現有任何不適當的行為發生，不論你的性別或性向是如何，我們將馬上禁止你一年內不得再來TwH3聚會或派對! 請記住，我們來TwH3開心的，請大家三思而後行!\n\n*******Disclaimer*******\n1- First time runners! Bring a change, set of clean clothes and shoes. Trail might be muddy, crossing rivers may happen, and hares are responsible if it is raining. (Blame them during the down-downs)\n2- hashers bringing first time runners, please, be in charge to babysit them along the trail.\n3- It is recommende"},
{"id":"cmqzl4xfx001v5vhnblq4xg8t","old_md5":"9948e4a474cdda05de05e982e028eb14","description":"TwH³ #2458 - The Lone Ranger Run\n\nFOLLOW COVID REGULATIONS: TEMPERATURE CHECK AND DISINFECT HANDS ON ARRIVAL\n遵守所有防疫規定 ，量測體溫以及消毒你的雙手\n\n\n******WHAT?*******\nA:A run\n路線：A to A\n\nLong: 8.5 km - Elevation / 爬升: 300m\nShort: 5.5 km - Elevation / 爬升: 200m\n\n\nHare: Flasher\n\n\nEverybody knows that heroes fight outlaws and save citizens and cities from danger when needed.\nEvery Sunday, TwH³ has a couple of heroes (the Hare and his/her Co-Hare) saving hashers from wasting their boring lives at home and offering them the chance of a great day out instead.\n大家都知道超級英雄會打擊犯罪，並在必要的時候拯救人民脫離危險。\n每周日，台灣健龍也有超級英雄雙人組（兔子與副兔）帶領跑友們走出家門，遠離無聊的生活奔向美好的一天。\n\nThis coming Sunday, our hero will be no other than Flasher. Few things you should know about Flasher are:\n- He is the current Metro Hash Trail Master\n- He knows more trails than anyone else in the island\n- He is the founder of the Run to Run group (bunch of losers)\n- He always runs alone\n- He will hare alone\n本周日的超級英雄將由The Flasher擔綱露出呈現，以下關於他的一些小知識：\n－他是台北捷兔的Trail Master（路線擔當）\n－他是本島上知道最多路線的人\n－他是跑去跑團的創始者（一群魯蛇）\n－他是獨跑俠\n－他沒有副兔\n\nYes, in a Lone Ranger Fashion but without the mask, Flasher will offer us a Long (8.5K) and Short (5.5K) run in Badouzi, Keelung City. The trail will have fantastic views, guarantee!!!\n是的，只差戴面具的獨跑俠Flasher在基隆市八斗子準備了一條長（8.5k）一條短（5.5k）的路線，保證會有超棒的風景！\n\nIn Flasher own words: “You know that hasher from Hsinchu, \"Likes it Long and Hard\"?...  This trail would be just right for her 😁. I might pick up a flour bitch on the day”.\n來自Flasher的話：你們知道新竹跑友\"Likes it Long and Hard （喜歡長又硬）嗎？她來跑這條路線是適得其所蛤，然後當天應該會找一位當麵粉挑夫。\n\n\n*******WHEN*******\nDate: Sunday July 17th 2022\nTime: Hares off at 14:30\n兔子兩點半起跑\n\n\n*******WHERE*******\nBadouzi Lookout \n八斗子觀景平台\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/NfeHVoWeNSDN9kzH8\n\n\n******HOW?*******\nTake bus #1579 which departs at Yuanshan MRT station. You can get on at Huaisheng Junior High School (right next to Zhongxiao Fuxing MRT station), Zhongxiao Dunhua MRT station, City Hall bus station and Nanjing Sanmin MRT station. Get off at last stop.\n巴士1579從圓山站發車，你可以在懷生國中，捷運忠孝敦化，市府轉運站及捷運南京三民站上車，坐到最後一站下車。\n\n\n*******PRICE*******\nMen $250\nWomen $200\n\n\n*******BASH*******\n傻大姐海景餐廳\n[redacted]\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/QcxUwPqm92EvKTwT6\n\n\n*******COVID*******\nUse hand sanitizer before giving the hash cash money.\n請在給Hash Cash前先消毒你的手\nIf you are at all worried about COVID-19 then stay home.\n如果你擔心病毒問題，請你待在家裡不要來\nIf you are a higher risk demographic please stay home.\n如果你是高風險族群，請你待在家裡不要來\nThis is for your safety and you can attend at your own risk.\n這攸關你的安全及健康，請自我斟酌負責是否來參加\n\n\n*******Dick Check*******\nAlthough we want you to have fun on the party bus and other hash events, remember that you being drunk isn’t an invitation to grope, harass someone or generally be a dick. Any inappropriate behavior will be met with an immediate 1 year ban from all Taiwan Hash events regardless of your gender and sexual orientation. We’re here to have fun and that’s it! Just remember, think about your mother before you act, that should get rid of your horn.\n*給全部跑友的提醒* 我們希望大家都在聚會和派對上玩得開心，但請注意，就算喝醉也不代表你可以隨意去摸來摸去、騷擾別人或是變成一個混蛋。當我們發現有任何不適當的行為發生，不論你的性別或性向是如何，我們將馬上禁止你一年內不得再來TwH3聚會或派對! 請記住，我們來TwH3開心的，請大家三思而後行!\n\n\n*******Disclaimer*******\n1- First time runners! Bring a change, set of clean clothes and shoes. Trail might be muddy, crossing rivers may happen, and hares are responsible if it is raining (blame them during the down-downs).\n2- Hashers bringing first time runners, please, be in charge to babysit them along the trail.\n3- It is recommended to 1st Time runners to bring their cellphone on the trail.\n4- This is a running event, it may include trails, climbing, snakes … runners are informed they are RESPONSIBLE for their OWN safety. Late Walkers/Runners will be rescued if missing at the finish line…\n5- Eat before joining to avoid low blood sugar.\n6- this event is including alcoholic beverages, please be responsible and don’t drive.\n1- 第一次來參加的兔友們，請攜帶更換的衣服及鞋子。路線可能會泥濘，也有可能會穿越 一些河。如果下雨的話，就怪兔子吧(你可以在down down時唸他們一下)!!\n2- 帶第一次來跑的兔友們，請自行負責照顧你的朋友!\n3- 我們建議第一次來跑的朋友們"},
{"id":"cmqzl4xp6001z5vhn144rghuu","old_md5":"85e3ed7b8e324d963a8a30645fba87a1","description":"TwH³ #2460 - The Führer on the Run\nFOLLOW COVID REGULATIONS: TEMPERATURE CHECK AND DISINFECT HANDS ON ARRIVAL\n遵守所有防疫規定 ，量測體溫以及消毒你的雙手\n\n\n******WHAT?*******\nA:A run\n路線：A to A\n\nLong: 8 km - Elevation / 爬升: 450 m\nShort: 5.5 km - Elevation / 爬升: 300 m\n\n\nHare: Triple P\nCohare: Swiss Goat\n\n\nThe German term Führer is generally associated with Adolph Hitler, a tyrannical dictator responsible of the Holocaust during the II Word War. However, in the German language, Führer has two meanings: guide or leader.\n德文中的「Führer」一詞意思是嚮導或領袖，然而一般提到這個字，通常會被聯想到希特勒，那位在第二次大戰中主導了大屠殺的獨裁暴君。\n\nOur Führer this week is Triple P, he is German, he is fast, and he is shy when he is not drunk. Also, he is the reason why our dear Hash Cash Doppelbanger got her hash name. \n以上增加各位非必要的知識，啊總之我們本週的引路人是Triple P - 德國人、很快、還沒醉之前很害羞...哦還有，他也是我們親愛的總務小姐 Doppelbanger 得到這個名字的原因之一。\n\nHe decided to choose a quasi-german as cohare Swiss Goat and together they will bring us down to the scenic area of Yingge District. \n總之，他決定找個大概算是德國人的 Swiss Goat當副兔，他們將攜手帶我們到位於鶯歌的美麗風景區。\n\nThey will offer a Long option having 8 km distance and 450 m of elevation, and a Short option having just 5.5 km distance and 300 m of elevation.\n將會有8k、爬升450的路線，也有精簡的5.5k、爬升300的路線。\n\nCome over this Sunday and try to catch the Führer.\n本週日加入我們抓兔子的行列！\n\n\n*******WHEN*******\nDate: Sunday July 31st 2022\nTime: Hares off at 14:30\n兔子兩點半起跑\n\n\n*******WHERE*******\nYingge\n鶯歌\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/ChYfr3ysnJeRQ5rz6\n\n\n******HOW?*******\nTake the train to Yingge Station and follow the flour to the run start.\n\n怎麼去: 搭乘火車至鶯歌站然後跟著麵粉走到起跑點\n\n\n*******PRICE*******\nMen $250\nWomen $200\n\n\n*******BASH*******\n烤霸\n[redacted]\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/3ZQMF3utHQp5pXiP8\n\n\n*******COVID*******\nUse hand sanitizer before giving the hash cash money.\n請在給Hash Cash前先消毒你的手\nIf you are at all worried about COVID-19 then stay home.\n如果你擔心病毒問題，請你待在家裡不要來\nIf you are a higher risk demographic please stay home.\n如果你是高風險族群，請你待在家裡不要來\nThis is for your safety and you can attend at your own risk.\n這攸關你的安全及健康，請自我斟酌負責是否來參加\n\n\n*******Dick Check*******\nAlthough we want you to have fun on the party bus and other hash events, remember that you being drunk isn’t an invitation to grope, harass someone or generally be a dick. Any inappropriate behavior will be met with an immediate 1 year ban from all Taiwan Hash events regardless of your gender and sexual orientation. We’re here to have fun and that’s it! Just remember, think about your mother before you act, that should get rid of your horn.\n*給全部跑友的提醒* 我們希望大家都在聚會和派對上玩得開心，但請注意，就算喝醉也不代表你可以隨意去摸來摸去、騷擾別人或是變成一個混蛋。當我們發現有任何不適當的行為發生，不論你的性別或性向是如何，我們將馬上禁止你一年內不得再來TwH3聚會或派對! 請記住，我們來TwH3開心的，請大家三思而後行!\n\n\n*******Disclaimer*******\n1- First time runners! Bring a change, set of clean clothes and shoes. Trail might be muddy, crossing rivers may happen, and hares are responsible if it is raining (blame them during the down-downs).\n2- Hashers bringing first time runners, please, be in charge to babysit them along the trail.\n3- It is recommended to 1st Time runners to bring their cellphone on the trail.\n4- This is a running event, it may include trails, climbing, snakes … runners are informed they are RESPONSIBLE for their OWN safety. Late Walkers/Runners will be rescued if missing at the finish line…\n5- Eat before joining to avoid low blood sugar.\n6- this event is including alcoholic beverages, please be responsible and don’t drive.\n1- 第一次來參加的兔友們，請攜帶更換的衣服及鞋子。路線可能會泥濘，也有可能會穿越 一些河。如果下雨的話，就怪兔子吧(你可以在down down時唸他們一下)!!\n2- 帶第一次來跑的兔友們，請自行負責照顧你的朋友!\n3- 我們建議第一次來跑的朋友們，帶著你的手機一起跑，以備不時之需\n4- 這是一個跑山的活動，這代表會有未開發的小徑、攀岩、蛇等等，參加者自行對自身安全負責。遲到或是走比較慢的兔友，我們如果發現你沒回到終點，我們會去找你\n5- 參加此活動前，請確保你來之前吃些東西，避免低血糖血壓狀況發生\n6- 這是一個提供酒精飲料的活動，喝酒不開車，開車不喝酒"},
{"id":"cmqzl4y4q00255vhn20uyancs","old_md5":"195bd1e126786faf16d24ebcd24c49f0","description":"TwH³ #2463 - The Mates on the Run\n\nFOLLOW COVID REGULATIONS: TEMPERATURE CHECK AND DISINFECT HANDS ON ARRIVAL\n遵守所有防疫規定 ，量測體溫以及消毒你的雙手\n\n\n******WHAT?*******\nA:A run\n路線：A to A\nLong: 7 km - Elevation / 爬升: 390 m\nShort: 5 km - Elevation / 爬升: 210 m\n\n\nHare: Period\nCohare: Big John\n\n\nIf Taiwan Hash is usually synonymous with absolute silliness, it can sometimes be a bit more serious.\n台灣健龍通常是終極傻逼的同義字，但有時候還真可以振作起來認真。\n\nThis Sunday run will mark our annual prisoner of war (POW) run in Jinguashi. \n本週日的路線是我們在金瓜石的年度戰俘營巡禮。\n\nDuring World War 2, Jinguashi was the location of a POW camp managed by the Japanese military to exploit gold and copper. Many Allied soldiers died in atrocious conditions while being held captive. \n二戰的時候，金瓜石曾是由日本軍管理的戰俘營地點，他們奉命在此地挖掘金與銅。許多戰俘在糟糕的勞役條件與生活環境下命喪於此。\n\nTo commemorate the lives of those who perished there, two of the most experienced hares will have the task of making this run unforgettable for us. Two mates known as Period and Big John.\n為了紀念在此犧牲的生命，兩位經驗老道的兔子Period\n及Big John規劃了一條令人難忘的路線。\n\nJoin our mates on Sunday in this historic place for some incredible vista, a beer check and... a swimming hole! Bring everybody with you as the run will be child and dog friendly and will have a short option for the weakest of us.\n本週日加入我們探索這個歷史悠久的區域，有美麗的景色，啤酒中繼站，還有一個游泳洞！記得摳所有你認識的人一起來，因為這是一個孩童寵物友善的一次跑跑，而且還會有簡短版路線給一些弱雞們。\n\n\n*******WHEN*******\nDate: Sunday August 21st 2022\nTime: Hares off at 14:30\n兔子兩點半起跑\n\n\n*******WHERE*******\nJinguashi \n金瓜石\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/m8TrMP1rHGYAyqFi7\n\n\n******HOW?*******\n4 ways to get to Jinguashi run start:\n- Bus 1062. Leaves Zhongxiao Fushin MRT every hour, on the hour. It takes about 1.5 hours. Get off at at Gold Museum stop. Follow flour to the start temple. About 700 meters.\n- Bus 965. Departs Banquio. Makes a stop at the Ximen MRT Station. Probably the best choice. Also takes about 90 minutes. Get off at the Xinshan 新山 stop. Walk 1 minute to the temple stairs.\n- My friend will drive his car. Can carry 5 persons. Leave from 台北市辛亥路二段185號 at 1315. Register here if you want to drive with Ming. About 1 hour.\n- Finally, drive yourself. Huge parking lot.\n怎麼去:\n有四種方法可協助抵達金瓜石起跑點:\n- 在忠孝復興捷運站搭乘每整點一班的客運1062, 大約1.5小時可抵達, 在黃金博物館站下車, 跟著麵粉走大約700公尺到起跑點的保民堂\n-在板橋公車站搭乘公車965, 也會停西門捷運站, 這可能會是最好的一個方式, 大約也是1.5小時, 在新山站下車後走上樓梯1分鐘就到起跑點保民堂\n- 兔子的朋友Ming會開車, 可載五人, 將於13:15自台北市辛亥路二段185號出發, 想加入請留言, 車程大約1小時\n- 最後是自己開車去, 有很大的停車場\n\n\n*******PRICE*******\nMen $250\nWomen $200\n\n\n*******BASH*******\nChuen Ji Hall \n金瓜石勸濟堂\n[redacted]\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/1pwNZTfu1CHyRBbY6\n\n\n*******COVID*******\nUse hand sanitizer before giving the hash cash money.\n請在給Hash Cash前先消毒你的手\nIf you are at all worried about COVID-19 then stay home.\n如果你擔心病毒問題，請你待在家裡不要來\nIf you are a higher risk demographic please stay home.\n如果你是高風險族群，請你待在家裡不要來\nThis is for your safety and you can attend at your own risk.\n這攸關你的安全及健康，請自我斟酌負責是否來參加\n\n\n*******Dick Check*******\nAlthough we want you to have fun on the party bus and other hash events, remember that you being drunk isn’t an invitation to grope, harass someone or generally be a dick. Any inappropriate behavior will be met with an immediate 1 year ban from all Taiwan Hash events regardless of your gender and sexual orientation. We’re here to have fun and that’s it! Just remember, think about your mother before you act, that should get rid of your horn.\n*給全部跑友的提醒* 我們希望大家都在聚會和派對上玩得開心，但請注意，就算喝醉也不代表你可以隨意去摸來摸去、騷擾別人或是變成一個混蛋。當我們發現有任何不適當的行為發生，不論你的性別或性向是如何，我們將馬上禁止你一年內不得再來TwH3聚會或派對! 請記住，我們來TwH3開心的，請大家三思而後行!\n\n\n*******Disclaimer*******\n1- First time runners! Bring a change, set of clean clothes and shoes. Trail might be muddy, crossing rivers may happen, and hares are responsible if it is raining (blame them during the down-downs).\n2- Hashers bringing first time runners, please, be in charge to babysit them along the trail.\n3- It is recommended to 1st Time runners to bring their cellphone on the trail.\n4- This is a running event, it may include trails, climbing, snakes … runners are informed they are RESPONSIBLE for their OWN safety. Late Walkers/Runne"},
{"id":"cmqzl502a002x5vhnosy1bzy2","old_md5":"aea2f5c1663a9b5a5b0809520917ee88","description":"This week we'll answer a question as old as humanity with part 2 of a rigorous investigation: Who is better at hashing? The girls, the guys or possibly even someone in-between? Get ready for the Taiwan Hash official BATTLE OF THE SEXES.\n本週我們將回答一個自有人類物種以來就存在的問題- 男人和女人, 揪竟誰比較會跑? 還是是介於這兩者之間的人? 歡迎來到台灣健龍性別爭霸戰!\n\nYou might remember an all male haring duo from TyMH³ hared run #2469 for us. Now it’s the girls turn, an all-star female TyMH³ haring team will bring you the freshest trails in Tamsui. Next Year’s TyMH³ GM Super White and former GM Juicy Kiwi are not to be underestimated.\n你可能記得那次由來自桃園捷運兔雙男兔子組規劃的#2469跑跑, 而這次是女人們表現的機會了!  一個雙女兔兔組將帶領我們前往淡水一個嶄新的路線, 明年的TyMH³ 會長 超極白(Super White) 以及前會長 奇異多汁果 (Juicy Kiwi)絕不是臭男生們可輕忽的對手。\n\nWill the hares manage to not get lost? Will the hares drink more beer and drink it faster than the guys? Do harriers drink wine faster than hariettes? Does wearing a dress make a harrier drink faster or slower? Add your hypotheses in the event chat and we’ll try to test them on the day along with any extra scientific trials the GM dreams up at down downs.\n女兔兔可以突破重圍不迷路嗎? 她們可以喝啤酒喝得比男兔兔更多更快嗎? 公獵犬喝葡萄酒喝得比母獵犬快嗎? 穿上裙子對飲酒速度有幫助嗎? 把你想到的所有問題丟進活動聊天群組裡, 我們會試著在吐槽大會運用一些會長可想到極度科學的測試方式一一解答。\n\nFrom the hares: After two months we will come back to the same area, it is a different 8k and totally runnable trail. On the trail, you can find animals from no foot to eight feet. The hares will show you the Taoyuan Metro Hash girl power. We won't screw up like the useless man from TyMH³, and we are the next year's GMs, hehe.\n兔子的話: 兩個月後我們又來到同個區域, 但將會是一個不一樣的8k, 且全程可跑! 在路上從沒有腳到八隻腳的動物都可以見到, 我們會讓妳們見識見識桃園捷運兔的女力, 不像某些沒用的桃園捷運兔男, 而且我們是明年的會長, 姆挖哈哈哈哈哈!\n\n\n******WHO? / 誰?******\nHare主兔: Super White \nCohare副兔: Juicy Kiwi\n\n\n******WHAT? / 蝦咪*******\nA:A run / 路線：A to A\n8 km + Elevation: 0 m / 爬升: 0 m\n\n\n*******WHEN / 啥時*******\n\nDate: Sunday November 13th 2022\nTime: Hares off at 14:00\n兔子兩點起跑\n\n\n*******WHERE / 哪兒*******\n\nTamsui Yishan Jiying Temple\n淡水義山集應廟\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/fWsAwRzHqLDDqe4R7\n\n\n******HOW? / 怎去*******\n\nTake any bus to Yishan Village (Kangshu Factory).\n搭乘公車到義山里(康舒廠)站下車\n\n\n*******PRICE*******\n\nMen $250\nWomen $200\n\n\n*******BASH / 晚餐*******\n\nBei Hai'an Restaurant\n[redacted]\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/gEnLq9sX4JYUi2Ge9\n\n\n*******COVID*******\n\nUse hand sanitizer before giving the hash cash money.\n請在給Hash Cash前先消毒你的手\nIf you are at all worried about COVID-19 then stay home.\n如果你擔心病毒問題，請你待在家裡不要來\nIf you are a higher risk demographic please stay home.\n如果你是高風險族群，請你待在家裡不要來\nThis is for your safety and you can attend at your own risk.\n這攸關你的安全及健康，請自我斟酌負責是否來參加\n\n\n*******Dick Check*******\n\nAlthough we want you to have fun on the party bus and other hash events, remember that you being drunk isn’t an invitation to grope, harass someone or generally be a dick. Any inappropriate behavior will be met with an immediate 1 year ban from all Taiwan Hash events regardless of your gender and sexual orientation. We’re here to have fun and that’s it! Just remember, think about your mother before you act, that should get rid of your horn.\n*給全部跑友的提醒* 我們希望大家都在聚會和派對上玩得開心，但請注意，就算喝醉也不代表你可以隨意去摸來摸去、騷擾別人或是變成一個混蛋。當我們發現有任何不適當的行為發生，不論你的性別或性向是如何，我們將馬上禁止你一年內不得再來TwH³聚會或派對! 請記住，我們來TwH³開心的，請大家三思而後行!\n\n\n*******Disclaimer*******\n\n1- First time runners! Bring a change, set of clean clothes and shoes. Trail might be muddy, crossing rivers may happen, and hares are responsible if it is raining (blame them during the down-downs).\n2- Hashers bringing first time runners, please, be in charge to babysit them along the trail.\n3- It is recommended to 1st Time runners to bring their cellphone on the trail.\n4- This is a running event, it may include trails, climbing, snakes … runners are informed they are RESPONSIBLE for their OWN safety. Late Walkers/Runners will be rescued if missing at the finish line…\n5- Eat before joining to avoid low blood sugar.\n6- this event is including alcoholic beverages, please be responsible and don’t drive.\n1- 第一次來參加的兔友們，請攜帶更換的衣服及鞋子。路線可能會泥濘，也有可能會穿越 一些河。如果下雨的話，就怪兔子吧(你可以在down down時唸他們一下"},
{"id":"cmqzl50ck00315vhnf6nw2caw","old_md5":"c3a1823f188c728bf566d656a2ac5cb9","description":"This week's hares are experienced and somewhat old school hashers, with many excellent runs under their belts – they know how to recce a trail, they know how to drink beer, they know how to mark a trail, and they know how to err... drink beer. \n本週的兔子資歷不淺而且某種程度而言還滿老派的，口袋裡有很多不錯的路線，懂探路，懂喝啤酒，懂做路，然後還懂...ㄟ \n我剛說過懂喝啤酒了嗎？\n\nThere’s their credential, now here comes the problematic part – planning vs execution. The recce photos look superb, the Mini Me photos are mega-lols, but by their own admission, they are a pair of “Sloppy Twats”, so how will things turn out this Sunday? Will the hangover’s be so extreme they don’t make it up the first hill? Will the marking be so sloppy that we must resort to following the scent of garlic? Join the run and find out this Sunday.\n總之以上是他們懂的部分，那麼現在來看看恐出問題的部分 - 計畫與執行。探路的照片看起來是很讚，你當妹妹我當洋娃娃的合成照片也很笑虧，但是根據他們自己承認過的，他們就是兩光仔，所以週日究竟會發生什麼事呢？會不會宿醉太嚴重根本爬不上第一道坡？還是記號做得太難認我們最後只好跟著蒜味跑？本週日來一探究竟！\n\nOur hare, Finishes on His Knees, was delighted when we told him that Pussy Vindaloo be GM for the day. Right at the beginning of the year our GM was a bit drunk and slightly at a loss for a down down. He looked in to the blurry crowd and picked out a random face – we’re renaming you! Sloppy Seconds was reborn, Finishes on His Knees - could this be the third coming, and time for Sloppy Thirds perhaps? \n兔子 高跪射底線(Finishes on His Knees)聽到當天騷嗆咖哩喵 (Pussy Vindaloo) 將代理會長職務開心得不得了，想今年初某次吐槽大會，我們的會長有點醉醉的失了魂，眼前一片模糊之際隨便挑了一個人上台說要幫他重新取兔名！於是高跪射底線從此有了第二個換我(Sloppy Seconds) 這個名字，至於高跪射底線...取名儀式會不會第三次重演？這次第三個換誰呢？\n\nBe sure to attend if you are looking for a renaming or have any other agenda items for the temporary GM!\n如果你很想把兔名換一換或是有什麼話想跟暫代會長爆料，本週日一定要來參加！\n\nHare: Finishes on His Knees\nCo-hare: Ménage à Twat\n兔子：高跪射底線\n副兔：查薄郎慎入\n\n******WHAT?*******\n路線：A to A  \n\nDistance: 8km\nElevation: 300m\n\n\n*******WHEN*******\nDate: Sunday November 27th 2022\nTime: Hares off at 14:00\n兔子兩點起跑\n\n\n*******WHERE*******\nXinglong Park 興隆公園\n\nNo. 128號, Xianyan Rd, Wenshan District, Taipei City, 116\n\n116台北市文山區仙岩路128號\n\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/ndwQ6sBk566jvcTJ9?g_st=ic\n\n\n******HOW?*******\nFollow the flour from Wanfang Hospital MRT.\n\nDrivers – there is a parking garage by Xinlong park \n\n搭乘捷運至文湖線(棕線)至萬芳醫院站跟著麵粉走\n\n興隆公園附近有地下停車場\n\n*******PRICE*******\nMen $250 Women $200\n\n\n*******BASH*******\n新味珍復古熱炒\n[redacted]\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/bo4Wa3ioLXJi9bZs5\n\n\n*******COVID*******\nUse hand sanitizer before giving the hash cash money.\n請在給Hash Cash前先消毒你的手\nIf you are at all worried about COVID-19 then stay home.\n如果你擔心病毒問題，請你待在家裡不要來\nIf you are a higher risk demographic please stay home.\n如果你是高風險族群，請你待在家裡不要來\nThis is for your safety and you can attend at your own risk.\n這攸關你的安全及健康，請自我斟酌負責是否來參加\n\n*******Dick Check*******\nAlthough we want you to have fun on the party bus and other hash events, remember that you being drunk isn’t an invitation to grope, harass someone or generally be a dick. Any inappropriate behavior will be met with an immediate 1 year ban from all Taiwan Hash events regardless of your gender and sexual orientation. We’re here to have fun and that’s it! Just remember, think about your mother before you act, that should get rid of your horn.\n*給全部跑友的提醒* 我們希望大家都在聚會和派對上玩得開心，但請注意，就算喝醉也不代表你可以隨意去摸來摸去、騷擾別人或是變成一個混蛋。當我們發現有任何不適當的行為發生，不論你的性別或性向是如何，我們將馬上禁止你一年內不得再來TwH3聚會或派對! 請記住，我們來TwH3開心的，請大家三思而後行!\n\n*******Disclaimer*******\n1- First time runners! Bring a change, set of clean clothes and shoes. Trail might be muddy, crossing rivers may happen, and hares are responsible if it is raining. (Blame them during the down-downs)\n2- hashers bringing first time runners, please, be in charge to babysit them along the trail.\n3- It is recommended to 1st Time runners to bring their cellphone on the trail.\n4- This is a running event, it may include trails, climbing, snakes … runners are informed they are RESPONSIBLE for their OWN safety. Late Walkers/Runners will be rescued if missing at the finish line…\n5- Eat before joining to avoid low blood sugar\n6- this event is including alcoholic beverages, please be responsible a"},
{"id":"cmqzl50r300375vhnbfxx4o6o","old_md5":"46a23775e65d8c34c1ffca2b0ddae611","description":"A year as the TwH3 GM takes its toll - on the mind, the liver and the gonads of anyone foolish enough to accept the huge irresponsibility and honor. The time has come for us to trade in our GM for a fresh one, and for 2nd Man In to be elevated to the honorary status of Hugh Hefner. He will relocate to the Playboy mansion and lurk in the background swigging cognac from his shoe as he watches the new GM and bunny girls take to the down down circle.\n經過一年的洗禮, 我們的會長的心智、肝、甚至那些當初愚蠢到接下這個重大責任的使命感都摧殘殆盡, 是時候來顆新鮮的肝汰換掉他了, 讓叫我第二名(2nd Man In)晉升到休海夫納等級的榮譽會員, 他將移居到花花公子別墅, 邊看著新會長跟兔女郎互動邊啜飲著他鞋裡的干邑酒, 用絲質睡袍掩蓋興奮的小會長作為背景畫面。\n\n\nCome and join us on Sunday December 11th to witness the almost certain erection and accession of Mexican Handjob. This is one last chance to ruffle his hair and pinch his cheeks before he continues in the footsteps of his Mexican forebearer and continues the great (and not so great) traditions of the hash! \n12月11日(周日)來加入我們見證幾乎可以確定接任會長的墨西哥手工活(Mexican Handjob)的崛起, 這也是你各位隨意弄亂他頭髮、捏他臉頰的最後機會, 接下來登大人的他將隨著墨西哥先祖延續這個美好(也不那麼美好)的台灣健龍傳統了!\n\n\nImportant note! 重要提醒\nDue to the ongoing embezzlement of funds and the diamond encrusted playboy thong hanging in the GM's closet, we will be offering 60 free bash places for the erection bash to anyone with 15+ runs. Any extra free spaces will be given away on the day to people with 5 or more runs this year.If you don't get a free bash you can still come and pay on the day like normal. \n污走一些跑跑資金加上典當一條會長衣櫃中的鑲鑽丁字褲後，我們有錢可以提供免費晚餐給60位15次跑次以上的兔友了！任何多出來的名額將提供給跑次5次以上的兔友們。如果你沒報名到免費名額, 仍然可以在當天繳費報名聚餐。\n\n\nHash Cash will be handing out special bracelets to the people who qualify for a free bash. To claim your free place, you have to pre-register here and COME TO THE RUN. Come and support the hash one last time and give the new GM some money to buy their own Playboy thong. \n這些名額將提供給今年最多跑次的兔友, 跑路費組(Hash Cash)會提供特殊手環作為免費通關使用, 請提前在Google 表單報名並出席本次跑跑, 來支持台灣健龍最後101次, 也給新會長一點起家金好買條自己的兔女郎丁字褲。\n\n\nN.B. To make sure we give the free places to the most deserving hashers and to help the knackered out and easily confused hash cash team, please pre-register for the bash by filling in the Google Form here: https://forms.gle/Cnaihgf97ZytqCda9\n\nIf the people with the free place don’t turn up, then we will give their free place to anyone who has run Taiwan Hash 5 or more times this year.\n注意: 為確保免費名額實至名歸, 且支援收銀過於勞累而搞混的跑路費組(Hash Cash), 請使用以下Google表單提早報名: https://forms.gle/Cnaihgf97ZytqCda9 \n如果那些免費仔沒有出現, 將由其他跑次5次以上的報名者遞補\n\n\nCHECK FOR YOUR NAME AT THE BOTTOM OF THIS ANNOUNCEMENT\n在下面看看有沒有你的名字!\n\n\nHare: 2nd Man In\nCo-hare: Mexican Handjob\n\n\n*****What?***** 甚麼?\nA-A Run\nDistance: 6.5 km (walking 1 hour)\nElevation: 0m\n\n\n*****When?***** 時間\nHares off at 2pm 兔子2點起跑\nBash starting at 6:00pm 晚餐6:00開吃\n\n\n*****Where?***** 哪\nYuanfu Community Park 員福社區公園\n236, Taiwan, New Taipei City, Tucheng District\n236新北市土城區\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/nuGmPunrzP2SN17M6?g_st=ic\n\n\n*****Drivers*****開車朋友:\nThere is a Parking Lot right at the run start\n起跑點有停車場\n\n\n******HOW?*******\nMRT to Tucheng Station, there will be flour from Exit 3 to the run start. Walking time is about 15min\nThere is also a YouBike station in the park.\n搭乘捷運至土城站下車, 三號出口外跟著麵粉走到起跑點, 步行約十分鐘, 公園裡也有YouBike可租借。\n\n\n*******PRICE*******\nMen $250 Women $200\n\n\n*****Bash***** 晚餐:\nSeafood Restaurant 水上鮮美食樓\n2F, No. 114, Section 2, Zhongyang Rd, Tucheng District, New Taipei City\n新北市土城區中央路二段114號二樓\nGoogle Map Pin: 水上鮮美食樓\n[redacted]\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/SdRdGoSKVt1165gdA?g_st=ic\n\n\n*****Free Bash List***** 免費晚餐\nUpdated as for 2022/12/05\n\n17000\n2nd Man In\n5G\n70% Gay\nCum Stain\nAll Night Long\nArsehole Protector\nArthur u Fag\nArthur’s Backdoor\nBaby Killer\nBalls in Your Cort\nBBC\nCum This Way\nCunt of the Litter\nDick in Mouth\nDoppelbanger\nDr. Binglang\nDry Pussy\nEggs Donor\nElwood Blues\nEuroTrash\nFIAT\nGodfather\nHerman\nHitler's Missing Testicle\nHun